<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Deuteronomy</book>
  <para style="h">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="toc2">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="mt">Deuteronomy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi Jordan lui chhak lam thlalêra Israel-ho an awm laia an hnêna Mosia thu sawi ziakna bu a ni. Jordan lui phai, Sufa ruama Tofel khua te, Laban khua te, Hazerot khua te, Dizahab khua te leh Paran thlalêr inkâra an awm lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Horeb tlâng aṭangin Kades-barnea chu Edom tlângrama kalin ni sâwm leh pakhat kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta ram an chhuahsan kum sawmlina, thla sâwm leh pakhat, ni khat ni chuan an hnêna hrilh tûr Lalpa sawi zawng zawng chu Mosia chuan Israel-te chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Amor mi, Hesbon khaw lal Sihona chu a hneh a, Basan rama Astarot leh Edrei khaw lal Oga pawh a hneh tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab ram, Jordan lui chhak lama an awm lai khân Pathian dân leh thupêkte chu Mosian a sawi fiah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Horeb tlânga kan awm lai khân Lalpa kan Pathian chuan, ‘He tlângah hian in awm rei tâwk ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In bûk ṭhiat ula, tawlh sawn rawh u. Amor-ho ram, tlângramah chuan kal ula, a vêl ramte fang rawh u. Jordan lui phai te, tlângram te, chhim lam ram te, Mediteranean tuipui kam thlengin kal rawh u. Kanan-ho ram te, Lebanon tlâng piah Eufretis lui thlengin kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He ram hi a ni, in thlahtu Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te leh an thlahte hnêna pêk ka tiam ram chu, fang ula, va hneh rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan mipui hnênah, “Horeb tlânga kan awm lai khân ka hrilh che u kha. Keimah ngawt chuan rit ka ti lutuk ta che u a, ka tlin ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan vâna arsi zâtin a titam ta che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chuan tûna in lêt sângin tipung che u sela, a tiam angin tihmuingîl che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In thubuai rem chu hahthlâk tham a ni ta; keimah maia tih sên a ni ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fing, thil chhût thiam leh hre zau, hnam tin aṭangin thlang chhuak ula, an kutah ka hlân ang che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chu chu thil tih âwm tak a nih pawh in hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, mi fing leh thil hre zau te, in hnam zawng zawng zînga thlan chhuahte chu ka kawltîr ta che u a; ṭhenkhat chu mi sâng chungah rorêl tûr an ni a, a ṭhen chu za chungah, a ṭhen chu sawmnga chungah. Chûng bâkah pawh hnam tina hotu tûr ka ruatsak bawk che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Anni chu hetiang hian ka hrilh a: In mite zînga thubuai awm rêng rêng chu ngun takin ngaithla ula, nangmahni mi chauh inkâr thu a ni emaw, in zînga hnam dang awm vete nêna in inkâr thu emaw dik takin, hleih nei lovin rêl ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Duhsak bîk nei suh ula, tu pawh ni se, thuhmun veka enin an thu rêlsak ang che u. Tu mah vênthâwn nei suh ang che u, in thu rêl thlûk chu Pathian aṭanga lo chhuak a ni. In tâna rêl khirh lutuk chu ka hnênah in rawn thlen ṭhîn ang a, ka lo rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In tih tûr dangte pawh ka hrilh che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kan Pathian Lalpa thu ang chuan kan ti a. Horeb tlâng kan chhuahsan a, thlalêr ram zau tak leh râpthlâk taka Amor-ho awmna tlângram kawng chu kan kal tlang a, Kades-barnea kan va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei chuan, ‘Amor-ho tlângram in lo thleng ta, Lalpa kan Pathian min pêk ram chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />En teh u, Lalpa , in Pathian chuan ram chu a pharh duai hi, lût ula, in pate Pathian, Lalpa sawi angin nei rawh u, hrilhhaiin hlauthâwng suh u,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mahse, in zain in lo kal a, ‘Ram chu va ena, kan kalna tûr te, kan luhna tûr khawpui chanchin te rawn thlen leh tûrin en thlithlaitu i tîr ang u,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ṭha ka ti ve bawk a, hnam tin zîng aṭangin mi pakhat zêl, mi sâwm leh pahnih kan thlang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An kal ta a, tlângramah chuan an han chho va, Eskol ruam an thleng a, an en thlithlai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Theirahte chu an rawn hâwn a, thu an rawn thlen a, ‘ Lalpa , kan Pathian min pêk ram chu a lo ṭha kher mai!’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nimahsela, in kal duh lo va, Lalpa in Pathian thupêk chu in nawrhsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In phunnawi a, ‘ Lalpa hian min hua a ni; Aigupta ram aṭangin min hruai chhuak a, Amor-ho kutah min pe dâwn a lo ni, min tihchhiat a lo tum a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Engah tehlul nge kan chhoh vang, chuta awmte chu keini aia lian leh sâng pui pui an ni a, an khuate lah a lian a, vân tawng tawnga kulh nei an ni; Anak-ho pawh kan hmu, tia kan unauten an rawn sawi kha kan hlau a ni’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anniho chu hlau suh ula, zâm phah hek suh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in hmahruaitu a ni a, ani chuan a dopui dâwn che u alâwm; Aigupta ramah in hmuh ngeiah in tân thil a tih ṭhin ang khân a ti zêl dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thlalêra in thang chhûng zawng pawh khân kawng engkimah a hruai che u a, pain a fa a pua angin he hmun hi a paw thleng che u tih in hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />He thilah hian Lalpa in Pathian chu in ring ngam lo a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />in hma a hruai zêl a, in bûk khuarna tûr a zawn chhuahsak che u a, zânah mei êng, chhûnah chhûm dingin a hruai ṭhîn che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan in thâwm a lo hria a, a thinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘He chhuan sual tak zînga pakhat mah hian, ram ṭha tak an pate hnêna pêk ka tiam chu an hmu hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An zînga mi pakhat Jefunea fapa Kaleba chauh hian a hmu ang, a rah apiang ram chu a fate rochan zêl tûrin ka pe ang, Lalpa chu a zui tlat avângin’ tiin thu a tiam tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nangmahni avângin Lalpa chu ka chungah pawh a thinur a, ‘Nang pawhin ram chu i hmu lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nuna fapa, i kaihza vêngtu Josua erawh hi chuan a hmu ang: fuih sauh sauh rawh, he ram hi Israel-te a neihtîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />In fanau tê tê, ‘râl man mai mai tûr’ in tihte, a chhia a ṭha la hre pha lote erawh hi chu, chu ramah chuan an lût ang a, an nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />In za hian kîr leh ula, Tuipui Sen lam panin thlalêrah kal rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Nangni chuan ka hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chungah thil sual kan ti a ni, tlângramah chuan kan han chho vang a, kan Pathian, Lalpa thupêk ang chuan kan han bei ang e,’ in ti a. Hriam in keng ṭheuh va, tlângrama han chhoh chu awlsam hle tûrah in ngai vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Chho teh suh u, han bei hek suh u, in zîngah ka awm lo, an lo that ngei ang che u,’ tiin hrilh rawh min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chu chu ka hrilh che u a, in ngaithla duh lo va; Lalpa thupêk chu in zâwm duh lo va, tlângramah chuan in kal chho lui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chûng lai tlângrama awm, Amor mite chuan an rawn bei lêt che u a, khuaiin mi a ûm ang maiin an ûm che u a. Horma thleng rawkin an ûm thla che u a, Edom tlângramah an hneh ta che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lalpa lam in lo hawi a, a hnênah in ṭap a; mahse, Lalpa chuan in aw a lo hre duh lo va, a lo ngaithla duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tichuan, Kades-barnea-ah chuan rei tak in awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“A tâwpah zawng Lalpa thupêk angin kan kîr leh ta nge nge a; Tuipui Sen lam kan pan a, Edom tlângram chu rei tak kan hêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Hêng tlâng hi in hêl rei lutuk ta, hmâr lam pan rawh u,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom tlângram in kal tlang dâwn a, in laichîn hla tawh tak, Esauva thlahte ram chu in kal tlang dâwn, an lo hlau hle ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, in bei tûr a ni lo, an ram chu tawng hnih khat lek pawh ka pe dâwn lo a che u. Seir tlângram chu Esauva thlahte tân ka pe tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chaw leh tui in duh chuan an hnên aṭangin in lei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chuan kawng tinrêngah mal a sâwm che u a, thlalêr zau taka in vah lai te khân a enkawl zêl che u a, in Pathian Lalpa chuan kum sawmli chhûng chu a awmpui che u a, eng mah in tlâkchham loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tichuan, kan kal zêl a, kan unau Esauva thlah, Seir tlânga awmte chu kan hêl a. Elath leh Ezion-geber aṭangin Jordan phai kawngah kan kal a; hmârchhak lam hawiin Moab ram kan pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Lota thlah, Moab-ho chu tibuai suh u, in bei tûr a ni lo. Ar khawpui chu an neih atâna ka pêk a ni, an ram chhetê pawh ka pe dâwn lo che u a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Ar khuaah hian milian chak tak tak Em an tihte chu an awm ṭhîn. Milian chi dang, Anak an tihho tluka sâng bawk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Refa-ho tih an ni bawk, mahse, Moab-ho chuan Em-ho an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom ramah hian Hor-ho an awm ṭhîn a; mahse, Esauva thlahte hian an ûm chhuak a, an tidarh vek a, an ram chu an luah ta a ni. Chutiang bawkin Israel pawhin Lalpan ram a pêka lo awmte chu an hnawt chhuak a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Lalpa thupêk angin Zered lui kan kân a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kades-barnea kan chhuahsan aṭang khân kum sawmthum leh pariat a vei tawh a; khatih laia râlkai chin zawng zawng chu Lalpa sawi ang ngei khân an thi vek tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan chûng mite chu a ngaimawh tlat a, an thi zo ta nge nge a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“An thih zawh vek hnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Vawiin hian Moab-ho ramri, Ar khawpui kiangah in kal tlang dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon-ho, Lota thlahte ram in va thleng ang a, anni chu chawk buai suh ula, bei hek suh ang che u, an ram chu an awmna atân ka pe tawh a ni, chhetê pawh ka pe lo vang che u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Chûng ram chu Refa-ho ram tih a ni ṭhîn. Amon-ho chuan hêng mite hi Zamzum-ho an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anak-ho ang bawka sâng an ni, tam tak an ni a, hnam chak tak an ni ṭhîn; mahse, Lalpa chuan a tihlum zo va; Amon-hovin an ram chu an nei a, an luah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Esauva thlah, Edom mite tân Seir chu Lalpan chutiang bawk chuan a tihsak a ni. Lalpa chuan Hor-ho chu a tiral a; Edom-hovin an ram chu an luah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mediteranean tuipui kamah Kret thliarkâr mite an lo awm a, a tîra awm Av-ho chu an tiboral a, an ram chu an luah a, Gaza thlengin an neihsak ta vek a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Moab ram kan pelh hnuin Lalpa chuan, ‘Tho la, Arnon lui hi kân rawh u, Amor lal Sihona, Hesbon khaw lal chu, a ramte nên, in kutah ka pe ta a; bei ula, a ram chu chhuhsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawiin aṭang hian in hmaah vân hnuaia awm zawng zawng ka tizâm dâwn a ni, in hming mai pawh an hriatin an khûr zawih zawih ang,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Kedemot thlalêr aṭangin Hesbon lal Sihona hnênah remthu kengin palai ka tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘I ramah kan lo kal tlang ang e, lamlianpui chauh kan zawh ang a, ding lam leh vei lamah kan pêng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kan ei tûr chaw leh kan in tûr tui pawh in hnên aṭangin kan lei vek ang; kan Pathian Lalpa min pêk ram, Jordan râl kan thlen hma hian kan lo kal tlang ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Seir rama chêng Esauva thlahte leh Ar khuaa Moab awmte hnêna kan tih ang bawk khân i ram kan kal tlang ringawt min phalsak teh khai’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hesbon lal Sihona chuan a rama kan kal tlang chu a phal lo va; kan hneha a ram kan neihsak theih nân Lalpa chuan a rilru a tikhauh va, a tiluhlul a ni; tûn thlengin a ram chu kan neihsak ta rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan, ‘Sihona leh a ram chu i kutah ka pêk tâk che hi, a ram pawh neihsak ula, luah rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sihona leh a ho zawng zawngte chuan Jahaz-ah min rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kan Pathian, Lalpa chuan ani chu a fate leh a ho zawng zawngte nên min pe a, kan that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khua zawng zawng kan la a, khuaa awmte chu a hmei a pa, a lian a te, kan tiboral vek a, tu mah kan zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An rante erawh chu râllâk sumah kan la a, khuaa râllâk sum dangte nên kan nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Arnon luiruam chung tlânga khua Aroer aṭanga a luidunga khawpui awmte chu Gilead thlengin kan lâk theih loh rêng a awm lo, Lalpa kan Pathianin min pe vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amon-ho ram erawh chu kan tlawh lo, Jabok lui kan kai lo; luidunga khawpuite leh tlângrama khawpuite, Lalpa kan Pathianin tlawh a khapah te chuan kan kal lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hmâr lam panin Basan ram kan thleng a. Edrei khaw bulah an lal Oga chuan a mi zawng zawng nên min lo bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘Huphurh suh, a mite leh a ram hi, amah chawpin ka pe tawh a che. Amor lal Sihona, Hesbon khaw lal i sawisak ang bawk khân sawisa ang che,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa kan Pathianin Basan lal Oga chu a mite nên min pe a, pakhat mah zuah lovin kan that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Argob bial, Basan lal Oga ram chhûnga awm khawpui zawng zawng chu kan la a, khaw sawmruk zet a ni, a khua lâksak loh rêng kan nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hêng khuaahte hian kulh bang sâng pui pui, kawngkhâr leh a kalhna ṭha tak tak a awm vek a, an chhehvêl khuate pawh kan la vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hesbon lal Sihona kan sawisak ang bawk khân an khuate chu kan tichhe vek a, a hmei a pa, naupangte nên lam kan that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An rante leh an thil neihte erawh chu râllâk sumah kan nei zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hêng Amor lal pahnih ram, Jordan lui chhak lama mi hi Arnon lui aṭanga Hermon tlâng thlengin kan chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hermon hi Sidon-ho chuan Sirion an ti a, Amor-ho erawh chuan Senir an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Basan lal Oga ram zawng zawng chu kan chhuhsak vek a ni; tlângchhîp zâwla khua te, Gilead biala mi te chu Basan bial pum pui Saleka leh Edrei thlengin kan nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Refa-ho zînga la dam chhun chu Basan lal Oga hi a ni; ngai teh, a kuang chu lung kuang a ni a, tawng pangngai tawng kuaa sei, tawng li-a zau a ni: tûn thlengin Amon-ho khua Raba-ah a la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hêng ram kan lâk hnu hian Reubena leh Gada thlahte hnênah Arnon lui ruam chung tlânga Aroer khaw hmâr lam ram chu Gilead tlângram chanve nên kan pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilead ram la awm leh Basan ram chu Manasea thlah zâtve hnênah kan pe bawk a. Basan ram pum pui hi Refa-ho ram tih a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasea thlah Jaira chuan Argob bial, Basan ram hi, Gesur-ho leh Maaka-ho ramri thlengin a la a; khuate chu a hming chawiin hming thar a sa a, Havot-jair tûn thlengin an la ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Gilead ram chu Makira, Manasea fa ka pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben leh Gad thlahte chu Gilead leh Arnon lui inkâr ram hi ka pe a. Chhim lama an ramri chu Arnon lui lai tak zêl a ni a, hmâr lamah chuan Jabok lui a ni, Amon-ho nên an inri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawthlang lam ri chu Jordan lui hi a ni a, Galili dîl aṭangin Tuipui Thi, Pisga tlâng bulṭhut a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chûng lai chuan thu ka pe che u a, ‘ Lalpa in Pathianin he ram hi in chanpual atân a pe che u a, in zînga hriam keng thei chin chu in unau Israel nâwlpui hmaah Jordan lui in lo kai hmasa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ran in ngah hle a, in ran te, in nupui fanaute hi chu hêng ka pêk che u khuaahte hian an lo awm ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nangmahni ang bawka in unaute hian Jordan thlang lam ram Lalpa pêk tûrah râlmuang taka an awm ve theih hma chu in unaute hi in pui tûr a ni. Chumi hnuah chuan ka pêk tûr che u in ram chanpualah hian in haw thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Josua hnênah pawh ka hrilh a, in mit ngeiin lal pahnih chunga Lalpa in Pathian thiltih chu in hmu a; chutiang bawkin in kalna tûra lalte chu Lalpa chuan a sawisa dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chu huphurh suh ang che u, Lalpa in Pathian chuan a dopui zêl dâwn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chutih lai chuan Lalpa hnênah, ‘Aw Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hi i ropuizia leh i thiltihtheihzia i entîr ṭan chauh a la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leiah leh vânah hêng thil ropui i tih ang ti thei ve hi pathian dang rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Jordan lui kal kaiin ram ṭha tak, tlângram mawi tak tak, Lebanon tlângte chu, khawngaih takin min hmuhtîr ve teh,’ tiin ka ngên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nangmahni avângin Lalpa chu ka chungah a thinur a, ka thu chu a ngaithla duh lo va, Lalpa chuan, ‘A tâwk e, sawi pawh sawi tawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisga tlângchhîpah chho la, khawthlang lam te, hmâr lam te, chhim lam te, khawchhak lam te thlîr vêl ang che; i mit chuan hmu la, a rah zawng i rap ve dâwn lo a ni, Jordan lui i kai ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Josua chu a tum tiruh tûrin fuih sauh sauh la, i hmuh ramah hian he mite hi a hruai ang a, a neihtîr dâwn a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Beth-peor khaw ep ruamah chuan kan awm ta rih a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khai le, Israel-te u, thuruat leh awm dân tûr ka zirtîr che u kha pawisa ula, in fate hnênah Lalpa in thlahtute Pathianin a pêk che u ram chu dam taka in luah theih nân zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ka pêk che u hi in belhchhah tûr a ni lo va; Lalpa in Pathian thu ka hrilh che u chu hmaih in nei tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peor tlânga Lalpa thiltih in hmuh ṭheuh kha, Peor tlânga Baal betute a tihhlum vek kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni Lalpa vuan tlattute erawh chu tûn thlengin in la dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, kan Pathian Lalpa min hrilh ang ngeiin, a thuruatte leh awm dân tûr ka zirtîr che u kha, in luah tûr ram in thlen hunah zâwm ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng dânte hi pawisa ula, zâwm tlat ang che u; hnam dangten an hriat ve hunah, ‘He hnam hi hnam fing tak leh changkâng tak an lo nih hi,’ an ti ang a, in finzia leh in changkân bîkzia an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian, a mite au lo chhâwn zêl ṭhîntu ang hi, hnam dang, hnam ropui berte pawhin an nei ve hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawiina dân ka zamsak che u anga dân leh thupêk ṭha pawh hi hnam ropui ber te pawhin an nei ve em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, fîmkhur ula, in mit ngeia in thil hmuhte kha in dam chhûnga in theihnghilh loh nân vawng tlat ula, in fate leh in tute pawh, hrilh ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horeb tlângah khân Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Mite chu ko khâwm la, an damchhûng zawnga ka thu an awih a, an fate pawh min ṭih dân an zirtîr theih nân ka thu sawi hi hria se ka duh a ni’ mi ti a; chutiang ngei chuan tlângah khân in Pathian Lalpa hmaah in ding a ni tih theihnghilh lovin, in fate chu hrilh ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlâng chu a kâng a, meikhu chhah takin a khuh tlat a, a thim mup a, vân thlengin a thim a, a bulṭhutah in va kal a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mei aṭangin a rawn bia che u a, a aw chu in hria a; mahse, a riruang hmuh tûr a awm lo va, a aw chauh in hria a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thuthlung chu vawng tlat tûrin a hrilh che u a, thupêk sâwm, lungphêk pahniha a ziak chu zâwm tlat tûrin a ti che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a dân zawng zawng chu zirtîr tûr che uin min ti a. In awmna tûr ram in thlen hunah chûng chu in zawm tlat tûr a nih thu te in fate in hrilh ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Horeb tlângah khân mei aṭangin Lalpa chuan in hnênah thu a sawi a; mahse, a riruang chu in hmuh loh kha; fîmkhur hle rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milem, in biak atân milim siamin intibawlhhlawh suh u; mipa lem emaw, hmeichhe lem emaw tuk suh ula, chher bawk hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leia awm rannung rêng rêng lem te, chunglêng sava lem te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />leia bawkvâka kal lem te, lei hnuai tuia sangha lem te, in biak atân in siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vân lam in han thlîr ang a, ni te, thla te, arsi te leh vâna thil dang awm rêng rêng te khi chibai bûka an rawngbâwl in châk hlauh dah ang e; fîmkhur rawh u - Lalpa in Pathian chuan khîngte khi hnam dang biak ve atân lek a dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangni zawng, Aigupta ram, rawhtuina meipui ata chu a la chhuak che u a, tûna in awm anga ama pual ni tûrin Lalpan a hruai chhuak che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei zawng, nangmahni avângin Lalpa in Pathianin luah atâna a pêk tûr che u ram, ram ṭha taka kal tûrin Jordan lui ka kai ve a phal tlat lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei chu Jordan kal kai ve lovin he lai ramah hian ka thi dâwn a ni, nangni erawh chu kai ula, ram chu in va nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin thu a thlunpui che u kha in theihnghilh hlauh ang e. Eng lem mah in biak atân Lalpa in Pathianin in siam a phal loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In Pathian, Lalpa hi kan ral hmang mei ang a ni a, Pathian thîkthu chhe tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Chu rama rei tak in awm hnu, fate neia tuchhuan, chhuan hnih chhuan thum in neih hunah pawh milem rêng rêng in siam a, Lalpa in Pathian duh loh zâwng in tih chuan, lei leh vân chhâlin ka sawi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan lui kâna in va luah tûr ramah chuan in dam rei lo vang a, in boral mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hnam tin zîngah a tidarh ang che u a, chûngah chuan a dam khawchhuak chu tlêm tê chauh in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng ramah chuan mihring siam milim, thing emaw, lung emaw, ṭawng thei hlei lo, hre thei bawk si lo, hmu thei lo leh thil rim pawh hre thei lo in bia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mahse, chûng ram aṭang chuan, Lalpa in Pathian in ṭih takzeta, rilru zawng zawng nêna amah in zawn chuan in hmu leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan hrehawm in tuar ang a, a thu in awih tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In Pathian, Lalpa hi Pathian ngilnei tak a ni a, a hlamchhiah lo vang che u a, a tichhe hek lo vang che u; in pate hnêna thu a tiam tlat chu a theihnghilh bawk hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tûn hma, in pian hma daih, Pathianin leia mihring a siam aṭang khân chhui teh u; khawvêl pum pui hi zâwt chhuak ula, in thil hmuh ang leh in thil hriat ang hi an hre ve ngai em zâwt teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nangni anga mei aṭanga Pathian thu sawi ngaithlaa dam khaw chhuak hnam dang tu nge awm ve le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata in Pathian Lalpa chuan a mi atân a hruai chhuak che u ang khân tu Pathianin nge hmun khat aṭangin a mi tûr hnam hruai chhuak ve ngai? Nangni zawng, in Pathian chuan, a thiltihtheihzia leh a chakzia in hmuhah a tilang a; hri te leh indona te a awmtîr a; thil mak leh chhinchhiahna mak tak tak a ti a; thil hlauhawm pui puite thlentu a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpa hi Pathian chu a ni a; amah lo hi Pathian dang rêng an awm lo tih in hriat theih nân chûng chu a hmuhtîr che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A zirtîr theih nân che u vân aṭangin a aw a hriattîr che u a, leiah ngei a mei ropui chu a hmuhtîr che u a, chuta ṭang chuan a rawn bia che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />In pate kha a ngainat êm avângin an thlahte chu a thlang che u a, Aigupta ram aṭangin amah ngeiin hneh takin a hruai chhuak ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />In hmaah, in aia hnam lian zâwk leh thiltithei zâwkte a ûm chhuak a, an awmnaah a hruai lût ang che u a, ro atân an ram chu a pe dâwn che u a ni. Tûn thlengin chûng chu in ta a la ni ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuvângin, vawiin hian hre rawh u, theihnghilh hauh suh ang che u: Lalpa hi chung lam vân leh hnuai lam leia Pathian awm chhun a ni, Pathian dang rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuvângin, a thuruat te leh a thupêk te chu zâwm rawh u, in tân a ṭha ang a, in fate tân pawh a ṭha ang; kumkhuaa in neih atâna a pêk che u ramah chuan in dam rei bawk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jordan lui chhak lamah inhumhimna tûr khawpui pathum a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chûng khuaah chuan miin a hmêlma pawh ni lo, mi a tihhlum palh chuan a tlân thei ang a; an lo hum dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Reuben thlahte ramah, tlâng zâwl Bezer khua te, Gad thlahte ramah Gilead biala awm Ramot khua te, Manasea thlahte ramah Basan bial Golan khua te chu a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hei hi Israel-te tân Mosian Dân a târlan chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hêng thupêk te, thuruat te leh awm dân tûr te hi Aigupta ram aṭanga Israel-te an lo chhuah lai khân Mosian a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A hrilhna hmun chu Beth-peor tlâng ep, Jordan lui chhak lam Amor lal Sihona ram chhûngah a ni a, ani chu Mosia leh Israel-ten an hneh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chu ram chu an neihsak a, Basan lal Oga ram pawh an neihsak bawk a. Hêng Amor lal pahnihte hi Jordan lui chhak lama awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An ram lâk chu Arnon luiruam ko chunga awm Aroer khua aṭanga Hermon tlâng an tih inkâr ram hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan lui kam chhak lam phai pawh Tuipui Thi thlengin tlâng pang nên a huam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah “Israel-te u, hêng thuruat leh awm dân tûr in beng hriata ka sawite hi ngaithla rawh u, zir ula, zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan Pathian, Lalpa chuan Horeb tlângah thu min thlunpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa thuthlung hi kan pate tân a ni lo, keini, vawiina heta awmte tân hian a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlânga mei aṭang khân Lalpa chuan inhmachhawnin in hnênah thu a sawi a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khatih lai khân Lalpa leh nangni inkârah ka ding a, mei in hlauh avângin tlângah in lâwn ngam ve si lo va, Lalpa thu sawi sawichhâwngtuah ka ṭang a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan hetiang hian a ti, ‘Bawiha in awmna Aigupta ram aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u Lalpa , in Pathian chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kei lo hi chu Pathian dang rêng rêng nei suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“I tân milem siam suh, chung lam vâna awm emaw, leia awm emaw, lei hnuai tuia thil awm lem emaw i siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng chu kûnin chibai i bûk tûr a ni lo va, an rawng i bâwl tûr a ni hek lo. Kei Lalpa , i Pathian hi, Pathian thîkthu chhe tak ka ni; min hawtute chu an thlahte chhuan thum chhuan li thleng pawhin ka hrem ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />min hmangaiha ka thupêk zâwmtute erawh chu an thlah, a sânga sâng thleng chungah pawh ngil ka nei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“I Pathian, Lalpa hming chhâlin dâwt sawi suh; dâwta a hming chhâltu chu Lalpa chuan hrem lohvin a chhuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathianin thu a pêk che angin sabat ni hi hmang la, serh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna i thawk ang a, i hna zawng zawng i thawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni sarih ni erawh hi chu Lalpa tâna sabat ni a ni a, hna eng mah i thawk tûr a ni lo; i fapa te, i fanu te, i bawihpa te, i bawihnu te, i bâwngpa te, i sabengtung te, i ran rêng rêng te leh in khaw chhûnga hnam dang awm ve te pawhin hna an thawk tûr a ni lo; nangmah ang bawkin, a hmei a pa, an châwl ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ramah, mi chhiahhlawh in nih kha hre reng rawh u. Chuta ṭang chuan Lalpa in Pathian hian a thiltihtheihna ropui tak hmangin a hruai chhuak che u a nih kha. Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathian chuan sabat ni hi serh tûrin a ti che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa i Pathianin thu a pêk che ang khân i nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh; chutichuan, i dam rei ang a, Lalpa i Pathian pêk che ramah i hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tual that suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uire suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ru suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“I vêngte dâwtin hêk suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I vêngte nupui i ît tûr a ni lo, a in te, a bawihpa te, a bawihnu te, a bâwngpa te, a sabengtung te, a ta rêng rêng i awt tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hêng thupêkte hi a ni Horeb tlâng bula in lo kal khâwm laia a hrilh che u kha. Mei aṭang leh chhûm chhah thim mup aṭangin hêng thu hi ring takin a sawi a nih kha; thu dang sawi a nei tawh lo. Lungphêk pahnihah a ziak a, min pe a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tlâng chu a alh hluah hluah a, thim chhah mup aṭanga aw in hriat khân, hnam tin hruaitute leh in upate nên ka hnênah in lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘ Lalpa kan Pathian chuan a ropuizia leh a lenzia min hmuhtîr ta, mei aṭanga a aw chu kan hria a, vawiin hian Pathianin mihring a bia a, mihring chu a thi kher lo tih kan hre ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, engah nge thi mai theia kan awm leh ang? Mei râpthlâk tak khân min rawn kâng ral ang a, Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu kan hriat leh chuan kan thi tawh ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mei aṭanga Pathian aw hre si mihring dam khawchhuak rêng an awm ve em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathianin a sawi zawng zawng chu min hrilh la, kan lo ngaithla ang a, kan zâwm ang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan ka hnêna in thu sawi chu a lo hria a. Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Hêng miten i hnêna an thu sawi hi ka lo hria a, an sawi dik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutiang rilru chu pu fo ṭhîn sela a va ṭha dâwn em! Min ṭih ang a, ka thupêkte an zâwm ang a, an fate nên lam an hmuingîl kumkhua tûr:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An hnênah zuk chhuk la, an bûkah hawtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nang erawh chu ka bulah hian lo ding la, ka thupêk zawng zawng te, ka thuruat te leh awm dân tûr ka tih ka lo hrilh ang che; chu chu anniho hi i zirtîr dâwn nia; tichuan, ro atâna ram ka pêk tûrah chuan in zâwm ṭhîn dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian thupêk hi in zâwm fîmkhur hle tûr a ni; pakhat mah in hmaih tûr a ni lo va, in belh tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in kalna tûr a tihah chuan in kal zêl tûr a ni; tichuan, in dam ang a, in hmuingîl ang a, in ram neih tûrah chuan rei tak in dam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hêng thupêk te, thuruat te leh awm dân tûr te hi Lalpa , in Pathian chuan zirtîr tûr che uin min ti a ni. Chu ram chu in luah hunah zâwm ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In fate leh in tûte pawhin Lalpa in Pathian thuruat leh thupêk ka hrilh che u hi an zâwmin an ti tûr a ni; tichuan, an dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Israel-te u, hria ula, ti ngei tûrin inpuahchah rawh u; in tân a ṭha ang a, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ramah hian in pate hnêna Lalpa in Pathianin a tiam ang khân nasa takin in pung dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aw Israel-te u, ngaithla teh u, Lalpa , Lalpa chauh hi kan Pathian chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu in thinlung zawng zawngin, in theihtâwpin hmangaih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vawiina he ka thupêk che u hi in thinlungah châm tlat sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ngun takin in fate zirtîr ang che u. In chhûnga in ṭhut lai te, kawnga in kal lai te, in mut dâwnah te, in thawh dâwnah te sawi sawi ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In hriat reng theih nân in bânah te hrêng ula, chalhrênah te hmang ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In kawngka biangah te ziak ula, in tual kawngkaah te pawh târ ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“In pu Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna pêk a tiam ram chu Lalpa in Pathianin a pe dâwn che u a; khawpui lian tak tak leh mawi tak tak, in din ni hauh lo chu in nei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuta in chhûngah chuan thil ṭha tak tak in dah ni lo a awm ang a; in laih hah loh tuichhunchhuah te a awm bawk ang a; grep huan leh Oliv hmun, in siam hah ni lo te in nei ang. Lalpan chu rama a hruai thlen hunah che u chuan ei tûr eng mah in tlachham lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fîmkhur ang che u, bawih in nihna, Aigupta ram aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u Lalpa hi in theihnghilh hlauh ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chu ṭih ula, amah chauh chibai bûk ula, a hming chauh chhâlin thu tiam ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In vêla awmte pathian chu pakhat mah be ve suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In zînga chêng Lalpa in Pathian hi Pathian thîkthu chhe tak a ni, in chungah Lalpa in Pathian hi a thinur chuan khawvêl ata hi a tibo daih mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Masa tui hmuna in tih ang khân Lalpa in Pathian hi fiah suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian thupêk chu uluk takin zâwm ula, a thupêkte leh a thuruat a hrilh che u chu awih ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa ṭha tihzâwng leh dik a tih chu ti ula, in tân a ṭha ang a, in pate pêk a tiam tawh ramah in lût ang a, in nei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa sawi tawh angin in hmêlmate chu in hmaah a hnawh chhuahsak vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nakin hnuah in faten, ‘Hêng thupêk te, thuruat te, awm dân tûr te, Lalpa kan Pathian hrilh che u hi engtizia nge?’ tia an zawh hunah che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hetiang hian chhâng ang che u, ‘Aigupta ramah Farawa bawih kan ni a, Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram ata chu min hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thil mak te, chhinchhiahna ropui tak tak leh râpthlâk tak tak Aigupta ramah te, Farawa leh a hote chungah te a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan min hruai chhuak ta a, he ram, kan pate hnêna pêk a tiam ramah hian min hruai luha min pêk a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hêng thuruatte hi ti vek tûrin thu min pe a, kan ṭhatna tûrin Lalpa kan Pathian chu ṭih fo tûrin min ti a; tichuan, kan za-in vawiin thleng hian min la zuah ta zêl a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng a thupêk min hrilh zawng zawng hi ngun taka kan zawm chuan kan tân a ṭha ang,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chuan in neih tûr ramah chuan a hruai lût ang che u a, chûnga awm hnam sarih, nangni aia tam zâwk leh chak zâwk, Hit mi te, Girgas mi te, Amor mi te, Kanan mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te chu a hnawh chhuahsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in kuta a pêk hunah che u chuan in hneh ang a, in that vek tûr a ni. Thu thlunpui suh ula, lainat hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inneih pawlh suh u, in fate nupui pasalah neihsak hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In fate an hruai kawi ang a, pathian dang an biaktîr mai ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu in chungah a thinur ang a, a tiboral mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, an maichâmte chu ṭhiatsak vek ula, an lungphunte tichhia ula, an Aseri lim phunte chu kit ula, an thing milimte chu hâl vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nangni zawng, Lalpa , in Pathian tâna serh hran in ni a; Lalpa , in Pathian chuan khawvêla hnam tinrêng zîng ata a pual bîk ni tûrin a thlang tawh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam dang aia in tam zâwk avânga hmangaiha thlang che u a ni lo va; hnamah chuan a tlêm ber in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hmangaih hrim hrim avâng che u leh in pate hnêna a thutiam tihpuitlin a duh avângin, Aigupta lal Farawa bawih ata, kut chak takin a tlan chhuak che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, hre rawh u, Lalpa , in Pathian chauh chu Pathian a ni a, Pathian rinawm, a thutiam vawng tlat a, amah hmangaiha a thupêk zâwmtute chunga chhuan sâng thlênga ngilnei ṭhîn chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah hawtute erawh chu tichhe tûrin a thungrûl ang a, amah hawtu chu a zuah lo vang a, an dam chhûng la lain a hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, thupêk te, thuruat te leh awm dân tûr te vawiina ka hrilh che u hi in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hêng awm dân tûrte hi in pawisak a, hetianga in awm a, in zawm chuan Lalpa , in Pathian chuan in pate hnêna a tiam ang khân a thuthlung chu in tân a hlen ang a, in chungah ngil a nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmangaih ang che u a, malsâwmin a tipung ngei ang che u. In pate hnêna pêk a tiam ramah chuan in fate chu mal a sâwm ang a, in rama in thei phunte a tirah tiar tuar ang a, in buh te, in uain te, in hriak te a tihlâwk ang a, in kêl leh berâm te tam takin a tipung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnam dang zawng zawng aiin in hmuingîl ang a, in zînga mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw ching an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan in zîng ata natna tinrêng a la bo ang a, Aigupta rama hri te kha in vei ve lo ang a, nangmahni hawtuten an vei thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u rama hnamte chu tiboral ula, khawngaih suh u, an pathiante pawh in be ve tûr a ni lo; chu chu in awhna tûr thang a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hêng hnamte hi keini aiin an tam a, engtin nge kan hnawh chhuah theih ang?’ ti rilru suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chu in hlau tûr a ni lo. Farawa leh Aigupta mite, Lalpa , in Pathianin a sawisak dân kha hre reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Râpthlâk tak taka Farawa a hrem te kha in hmu a, thil mak leh chhinchhiahna te tiin ama kut chak tak hmangin a hruai chhuak che u a nih kha: khatiang bawk khân in mi hlauhte chungah ti ve leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu, Lalpa , in Pathianin in zîngah khawinghal a tîr ang a, in thah bângte leh biru in hmuh lohte chu an zûk hlum vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chu hlau rêng rêng suh u, Lalpa in Pathian, Pathian ropui tak leh hlauhawm tak hian a awmpui reng che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Lalpa , in Pathian chuan chûng hnamte chu zawi zawiin a ni a hnawh chhuah dâwn ni; anni chu in tihboral thuai a phal dâwn lo; chutilo chuan ram sakawlh an pung chak lutuk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan anni chu a pe ngei dâwn che u a; a tichiai chiam ang a, an chhe zo tho dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An lalte chu in kutah a pe ang a, vân hnuaia an hming hriat tawh hauh loh tûrin a tiboral ang; tu mah lo dang thei che u an awm lo vang a; in tichhe vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thing milim, an tuk chawpte chu in hâl ang a, a tuamna tangkarua leh rangkachakte chu ît suh ula, la hek suh u; in tân awhna thang hlauhawm tak a ni thei ang. Lalpa , in Pathian tân thil tenawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutiang thil tenawm chu in inah in la lût tûr a ni lo, nangni pawh chûng ang mai chuan in tenawm ve dah ang e. In ten êm êm ang a, in haw hle bawk tûr a ni, Lalpa ânchhe dawng an ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In pate hnêna Lalpa , in Pathianin ram pêk a tiam chu dam taka in luah a, in neiha, in pun theih nân vawiina thupêk ka hrilh che u hi zâwm vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan kum sawmli chhûng thlalêrah a vahvaihtîr che u kha hre reng rawh u; a tirethei che u a, a fiah che u a, a thupêkte chu in zâwm dâwn nge dâwn lo in rilru hriat a duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tirethei che u a, a tirilṭâm che u a, a chângin in hriat ngai loh, in pi pute pawhin an hriat ngai loh chawin a hrai che u a; mihring hi chaw ring ringawtin a nung tûr a ni lo va, Lalpa kâ aṭanga thu tinrêng chhuakte chu a ring bawk tûr a ni tih in zir a duh avâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng kum sawmli chhûng hian kawr pakhat mah in ha chhe lo va, in keruh a nâin a vûng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miin a fa a thunun a, a hrem ang hian, Lalpa , in Pathian chuan a thunun ṭhîn che u a ni tih in hre reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian thupêk chu in zâwm ang a, a duh angin in nung ang a, ani chu in ṭih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan ram ṭha takah a hruai dâwn che u a ni, luite tui luang hawk hawk tamna, tuihna leh lei chhûngrila tui lo chik chhuak tamna, tlâng leh ruam nuam tak tak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />huit leh barli ṭhatna ram, grep te, theipui te, theibuhfaite rah duhna, Oliv leh khawizu tamna ramah chuan a hruai dâwn che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chutah chuan, tlâkchham nei lovin duh tâwkin chaw in ei ang a; chûng rama lungte chu thîr a ni a, tlângah te chuan dâr laih chhuah tûr a tam mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kham tâwk ei tûr in neih a, ram ṭha tak a pêk che u avângin Lalpa , in Pathian chu in fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“A thupêk te, awm dân tûr a tih te, a thuruatte vawiina ka hrilh che u hi zâwm duh lovin Lalpa , in Pathian hi in theihnghilh hlauh ang e, fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puar tâwk leh kham tâwk ei tûr in neih a, in ṭha tak tak in saka in luah hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in bâwng te, berâm leh kêl te a lo puna, tangka leh rangkachak in lo ngah a, in neih apiang a lo hmuingîl viau hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in chapo anga Aigupta bawih aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u Lalpa , in Pathian chu in theihnghilh hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan thlalêr ram zau tak leh hlauhawm pui puiah a hruai tlang che u a, rûl te, rûl chuk na mi te leh khawmualkaikuang tamna ramah te, tui awm lohna ram rovah te in kal khân lungpui chang tak aṭangin tui a pe che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlalêrah khân in pate pawhin an hriat ngai loh Mana chuan a châwm che u a, fiah nân che u leh in tân a ṭha dâwn nge dâwn lo in hriat theih nân hrehawm a tuartîr ṭhîn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, in chak avâng leh thil in tih theih avânga hausa emaw inti suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathianin hausa thei tûrin a tichak che u a ni tih hre reng ang che u; in thlahtute hnêna a thutiam chu ani chuan a la thlah loh avâng a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chu theihnghilh rêng rêng suh u, pathian dangte ngaihsakin chibai bûksan hek suh u; chutianga in tih vaih chuan, ka hrilh lâwk a che u, in boral ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian aw hi in pawisak loh chuan, Lalpan in luahlan tûr hnamte a tiboral angin nangni pawh a tiboral ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw Israel-te u, ngaithla teh u, vawiin hian Jordan lui in kân dâwn ta a; nangni aia tam leh chak zâwk hnam luahlan tûr leh khawpui lian tak tak, an kulh bang vân tawng hial te chu in lâksak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mi chêngte lah mi lian pui pui, sâng tak tak, Anak-ho thlahte an ni a, ‘tu nge Anak-hote chu dang zo vang?’ an tih ṭhinte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawiin hian hre rawh u, Lalpa , in Pathian chu in hmahruaitu a ni, in hmaah meialh chak tak angin a kal zêl dawn, a tichhia ang a, in hmaah a titlâwm zêl dâwn. Lalpa lo sawi tawh angin in hnawt chhuak vek ang a, an boral thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng mite hi Lalpa , in Pathianin a hnawh chhuah hunah, ‘kan ṭhat avângin Lalpa chuan he ram hi min pe a, hêng hnamte hi an sual avângin a hnawt chhuak a ni,’ in ti ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In ṭhat avâng leh in nun a ngîl avânga an ram hi neihsak in ni lo; hêng hnamte hi an sual êm avângin Lalpa , in Pathian hian a hnawt chhuak a ni; Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna a thutiam kha tihpuitlin a tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , in Pathianin ram ṭha tak hi, in ṭhat avânga pe che u a ni lo tih hre reng rawh u, mi luhlul tak in nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thlalêrah khân Lalpa , in Pathian chu in tihthinur ṭhin kha hre reng ula, theihnghilh suh u. Aigupta ram in chhuahsan ni aṭanga tûn thlengin Lalpa lakah hel in chîng hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb tlângah pawh khân Lalpa chu in tithinur a, tihboral vek che u duh hial khawpin a thinur a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangni nêna Lalpa thuthlung, lungphêka ziak chu, la tûrin tlângah ka han kal a, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli eng mah ka ei lo va, ka in hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inkhâwmpui lai khân mei aṭangin Lalpa chuan in hnênah thu a sawi a, chûng zawng zawng chu lungphêkah, Pathianin ama kut ngeiin a ziak a, Lalpa chuan mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a ral hnu chuan thuthlung ziakna lung phêk pahnih chu Lalpa chuan mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Tho la, chhuk thla vat teh, Aigupta ram aṭanga i mi hruai chhuahte khu an che khawlo nasa mai, awm dân tûr ka hrilh an pênsan a, milim chhûn chawp an siam tâk khu,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan, ‘Hêng mite luhlulzia hi ka hria alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lo ngawi mai rawh, tu ma hriat tawh hauh loh tûrin ka han tiboral teh ang. Nangma thlahte aṭangin anni aia thil ti thei zâwk leh tam zâwk hnam ka din mai teh ang,’ a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tlâng aṭang chuan ka kîr thla a, thuthlung ziakna lungphêk pahnih chu ka keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathianin awm dân tûr a hrilh che u kha in lo pênsan dêr tawh a, bâwngno lim chhûng chawpin in Pathian lakah thil sual in ti ta tih ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungphêk pahnih chu ka keng a, in hmuh ngeiah ka vawm keh ta a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In sualna avâng leh Lalpa tithinur tûra a pawi in khawih luih avângin Lalpa hmaah chuan ni sawmli leh zan sawmli eng mah eia in lovin ka bawkkhup leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nuai bo vek che u duh khawp hialin Lalpa chu a thinur a; a thinurna nasa tak chu a lo thawk ang tih ka hlau a ni; mahse, chumi ṭum pawh chuan ka thu chu Lalpa chuan min lo ngaihthlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tihhlum duh hial khawpin Arona chungah pawh Lalpa chu a thinur a, a tân pawh ka ngensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In thil sual tih bâwngno lim chu ka la a, meiah ka rawh a; vaivut anga dipin ka râwt a, tlâng aṭanga lui lo luang thlaah chuan ka phul a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tabera-ah te, Masa-ah te, Kibrot-hatava-ah te khân Lalpa in Pathian chu in tithinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kades-barnea-ah khân, ‘Kal ula, ram ka pêk tûr che u chu han luah rawh u le,’ tiin Lalpa chuan a tîr che u a; mahse, Lalpa in Pathian thupêk chu in do tlat a, a thu chu in ring ngam lo va, in ngaithla duh lo a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hriat tirh che u aṭangin Lalpa lakah in hel reng mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tihhlum vek che u a tum avângin ni sawmli leh zan sawmli chu Lalpa hmaah ka bawkkhup a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan ka ṭawngṭai a, ‘Aw Lalpa Pathian, i mi, i rochante hi tihlum vek teh suh, Aigupta ram ata chu ropui takin i tlan chhuak a, kut chak takin i hruai chhuak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hre reng la, hêng mite luhlulna te, an sualna leh an khawlohnaah te ngawt hian en teh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutilo zawng, Aigupta miten, ‘ Lalpa chuan pêk a tiam ram chu a hruai thleng zo lo a ni; a huat avângin thlalêra thah atân a hruai chhuak a lo nih zâwk hi,’ an ti ang asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I mi, i rochante an ni miau a, kut chak leh bân phar meuhva i hruai chhuahte kha an ni si a,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Lungphêk pahnih, a hmaa mi ang kha chher la, tlângah ka hnênah lo chho leh ang che; a bâwm tûr thingrem siam bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I tihkeh tâk lunga chuang ang kha, chûng lungah chuan ka lo ziak leh ang e, bâwmah chuan i dah dâwn nia’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Sitim thingin thingrem ka siam a, a hmaa mi angin lungphêk pahnih ka chher a, a pahnih chuan ka chhohpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungphêkahte chuan a hmaa thu ziak ang chiah, thupêk sâwm kha a lo ziak leh a; tlâng bula in pun khâwm ni-a mei aṭanga in hnêna a thu sawi chu Lalpa chuan min pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlâng aṭang chuan ka lo kîr a, bâwm ka siamah chuan Lalpa min hrilh angin lung phêkte chu ka dah a, tûn thlengin a la awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Israel-te chu Beerot-bene-jaakan aṭangin Mosera-ah an insawn a, chutah chuan Arona chu a thi a; kan phûm a, a fapa Eleazara chuan puithiam lalber hna chu a thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Gudgod-ah an insawn a, tui tam tak awmna hmun Jotbata-ah chuan an insawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chutih lai chuan Levia thlahte chu Lalpa chuan Thuthlung Bâwm enkawltu atân leh zâwn ṭhîntu atân a ruat a; Lalpa hmaa dinga, a rawng bâwl a, a hminga mipui mal sâwmsak ṭhîn tûrin tûn thlengin a ruat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Levia chite chuan an unau dangte angin ram bîk leh chanpual hran an nei ve dâwn lo va, Lalpa in Pathian sawi angin Lalpa hnêna thilhlan hi an chanpual ve tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tlângah chuan ni sawmli leh zan sawmli ka awm a, Lalpa chuan chumi ṭum pawh chuan ka thu a lo ngaithla a, Lalpa chuan tihhlum loh che u a remti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘Tho la, i mite hma hruai rawh, an pate hnêna pêk ka tiam tawh ram chu luah tûrin kal zêl rawh se,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Khai le, Israel-te u, Lalpa in Pathian hian in lakah eng nge a phût? Lalpa , in Pathian chu ṭih a, a duhzâwng apiang tih a, tihtakzeta rilru zawng zawnga amah chauh hmangaih leh a rawngbâwl te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in ṭhatna tûra vawiina ka hrilh che u, a thupêk leh a thuruat zawm te hi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vân pum pui te, lei leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng te neitu hi Lalpa chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chuti taka mi ropui chuan in pute chu a hmangaih êm êm a, hnam dang zawng zawng aiin a thlang ta hial che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, tûn chinah zawng Lalpa thu chu awih ula, luhlul tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hi pathiante Pathian, lalte Lal, Pathian ropui, thiltithei leh ṭihbaiawm tak chu a ni; tu mah thlei bîk a nei lo va, tlawn lungawi theih lah a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fahrahte leh hmeithaite thu chu dik takin a ngaihtuahsak ṭhîn a, in zînga hnam dang awmte pawh a hmangaih a, an ei tûr te, silh tûr te a pe tho a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, in zînga awm ram dang mite chu hmangaih ve ula, Aigupta ramah mikhual in zu nih tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu ṭih ula, a rawng bâwl ula, amah chu vuan tlat rawh u; intiamkam nân a hming chauh chhâl ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In mit ngeia in hmuh, thil ropui tak tak leh mak tak tak tia chawimawitu che u chu in Pathian hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In pute, mi sawmsarih chu Aigupta ramah an chhuk a, tûnah zawng Lalpa in Pathian chuan arsi zâta tamin a tihpun tâk che u hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tin, Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih ula, a thuruat te, awm dân tûr a tih te, a thupêk te chu zâwm reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chungchâng, nangmahni ngeiin in hriatte kha ngaihtuah ṭhîn rawh u. Chûng thil hretute chu in fate an ni lo, nangmahni ngei hi in ni, Lalpa in Pathian thununna natzia te, a ropuizia te, thu a neihzia te leh thil a tihtheihzia te in hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta lal Farawa leh a ram chhûnga chhinchhiahna thil mak tak tak a tih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta sipaiho, an sakawrte leh an sakawrtawlailîr a sawisak dân te leh an ûm lai che ua Tuipui Sen a chîmpiltîr dân te, vawiin thlenga a tihchhiat tâk thu te in hre vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He hmun in lo thlen hma, thlalêra in awm laia in chunga a thiltih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reubena thlah zînga Eliaba fa Dathana leh Abirama te chu an chhûng te, an puan in te, an chhiahhlawh te leh an ran te nên lam bûk dang kiang maia awm an ni na a, lei a lo kak a, an tlâk tâk bîkzia te kha in hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thil ropui tak tak tihte chu in mit ngeiin in hmuh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thupêk, vawiina ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm ula; tichuan, in lo chak ang a, in kalna tûr ramah chuan in lût ang a, in nei mai thei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram, in pate hnên pawha pêk a tiam tawh che u ramah chuan in dam rei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ram, in neih tûr hi, in awmna ṭhin Aigupta ram ang kha a ni ve lo; chuta in thlai chînte chu tuia châwmin in duat a ṭûl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In neih tûr ram chu tlâng leh ruama khat a ni a, vân ruahtui dawng tam ram a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan chu ram chu a duat hle a, kum tîr aṭanga kum tâwp thlengin a vil reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tichuan, vawiina ka hrilh che u thupêkte hi zâwm rawh u, Lalpa in Pathian hi hmangaih ula, tihtakzetin a rawngbâwl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ruah hmasa leh ruah hnuhnûngte chu in ramah a hun takah a sûrtîr ang a, in buh te, in grep te, in oliv te, a hun takah in seng thei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />in ran ei tûr hnimte pawh a tiduah ang. Nangni pawhin puar taka ei tûr in nei reng ang a, in tlai hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Fîmkhur rawh u, mahni inbum chawpin in pêng hlauh ang e, pathian dangte chibai bûkin an rawng in bâwl ve dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chu a thinur ang a, vânte khi khârin ruahte a sûrtîr lo vang a, leiah eng mah a rah lo mai ang. Lalpa pêk che u ram ṭha tak aṭang hian in boral thuai mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, a thute hi in rilru leh in thinlungah vawng ṭha ula, hlut hle rawh u, in hriat reng theih nân in bânah te phuar bet ula, in mit inkâr chalhrênah te dah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In fate pawh zirtîr rawh u, in chhûnga in ṭhut lai te, kawnga in kal lai te, in mut dâwnah te leh in thawh dâwnah te sawi sawi ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In kawngka biangah te ziak ula, in tual kawngkhârah te târ ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tichuan, in pate hnêna pêk a tiam ramah hian, lei hi vânin a khuh chhûng chu in fate nên rei tak in dam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A thupêk ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm ula, ti ṭhîn rawh u. Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih ula, a duh ang chuan awm ula, amah chu vuan tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan in hmaah hêng hnam zawng zawng hi a ûm chhuak ang a, in aia hnam tam zâwk leh chak zâwkte chu an ram in luhchhuahsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In rah apiang chu in ram a ni zêl ang. Thlalêr leh Lebanon inkâr, Eufretis lui leh Mediteranean tuipui inkâr ram chu in ram a ni vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu mah lo dang thei che u an awm lo vang. Lalpa in Pathian chuan a sawi tawh angin in kalna apiangah in hmaah mite a tizâm zêl dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, vawiinah hian malsâwmna dawn theihna leh ânchhe dawn theihna kawng ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vawiina ka hrilh che u Lalpa , in Pathian thupêk zawm hi malsâwm dawn theihna kawng chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vawiina ka hrilh che u Lalpa in Pathian thupêk awih duh lo te, tih tûr ka hrilh che u ti lova pêng bo te, in la hriat ngai hleih loh pathian dang biakte hi ânchhe dawnna kawng chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin in luah tûr ram a hruai thlen hunah che u chuan Gerizim tlângah malsâwmna kawng hi puang ula, Ebal tlângah ânchhe dawnna kawng hi puang bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hêng tlângte hi Jordan lui thlang lam, Kanan ram chhûnga awm Jordan ruam khawthlang lam, More sasaw thing kiang, Gilgal khaw bula awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jordan lui in kân ṭêp tawh a, Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u chu in luah dâwn hnai ta. Chûng ram chu in lâka, awmhmun in benbel hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thuruatte leh awm dân tûr vawiina ka hrilh che u zawng zawng hi zâwm ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian pêk che u ram in luaha, in dam chhûnga ngun taka in zawm tûr thuruatte leh awm dân tûrte chu hêng hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In va luahlan tûr hnamten an pathian an biakna hmun, tlâng sâng tak taka mi te, muala mi te, thingbuk tinrêng hlima mi te chu in tihchhiatsak vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An maichâmte chu in theh darh ang a, an lungphunte chu in chhu chhia ang a, Aseri lem an thingphunte chu in hâl ang a, thinga milim an tukte chu in chêk chhe vek ang a, hêng hmaahte hian chibai bûka an kûn leh tawh lohna tûr khawpin tichhe hlauh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hêng mite biak dân ang hi chuan Lalpa in Pathian chu in be ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel hnam zawng zawng ram chanpual aṭangin Lalpa chuan a hming awmna tûr hmun pakhat a thlang ang a, chutah chuan, a hmaah in lo kal khâwm ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan in hâlral thilhlante leh in thilhlan dangte in rawn hlân tûr a ni; in sâwma pakhat te, in thilpêk te, in intiamkam tlâkna thilhlan te, mahni duh thu-a thilhlan te, in ran no piang hmasa ber te in rawn dah ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutah chuan Lalpa in Pathian hmaah, in hnathawh mal a sâwm avânga in thil ṭha neihte chu in chhûngin hlim takin in ei ṭhîn dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan tûna mahni duh duha in tih ang hian in ti tawh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, Lalpa , in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u ramah lûtin in la châwl rih lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan lui in kai a, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u rama in chên a, in vêla in hmêlmate laka râlmuang taka in awm hunah erawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûr hmun a thlanah chuan, ka hrilh zawng zawng che u kha in rawn keng tûr a ni in hâlral thilhlan te, in inthawina te, in sâwma pakhat te, in thilpêk te, Lalpa hnêna intiamkam tlâkna thilhlan te chu rawn keng ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In fanu fapa te, in bawihpa leh in bawihnu te, in khuaa awm Levia chite nên Lalpa , in Pathian hmaah hlim takin eiin bâr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In duh duhna hmunah in hâlral thilhlante hi in hlân tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In zînga hnam khat ram chanpual Lalpa hmun thlanah chauh in hâlral thilhlante hi in hlân ang a, tih tûr ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“In ran vulhte erawh chu in awmna apiangah in talh thei ang. Lalpa in Pathianin sa a pêk apiang che u chu in ei thei ang; mi bawlhhlawh leh mi thiangte pawhin sakhi leh sazuk sa angin in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sa thisen erawh chu in ei tûr a ni lo, leiah a luang ral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sâwma pakhat in pêk buh te, uain te, oliv hriak te, in ran no neih hmasak te, in intiamkam tlâkna sa te, mahni duh thua thilhlan sa te leh in thên thilhlan sa rêng rêng te chu mahni khuaah in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hmun thlanah chuan a hmaah ngei in ei tûr a ni. In fanu in fapa te, in bawihpa leh in bawihnu te, in khuaa awm Levia chi te nên, Lalpa hmaah chuan in thawhrah te chu hlim leh lâwm takin in ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In rama in awm chhûng chuan Levia chite hi ngaihthah hauh suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a tiam anga in ramri a tihzau hunah chuan in duhna apiangah in sa châkzâwng chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming dahna tûr hmun a thlan chu, in awmna aṭanga a hlat viau chuan Lalpa pêk che u in ran vulhte chu ka hrilh che u ang hian in talh thei ang: in duh tâwkin mahni inah a sa chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sakhi leh sazuk sa in ei angin mi thiangte leh mi bawlhhlawh lai te pawhin a sa chu an ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sa thisen erawh chu ei rêng rêng suh u, nunna chu thisenah a awm a, a nunna chawpin in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thisen chu tui angin leiah leihbua ula, ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thu anga in tih chuan, Lalpa chu a lâwm ang a, in thlahte leh in tân a la ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna hlan in tiam thil serhte erawh chu a hmun ruatah chuan in rawn dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian maichâma hâlral thilhlan chi te, maichâma thisen theha, a sa ei ho tûr chite chu, chutah ngei chuan in rawn dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng ka thu hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm thlap ula, Lalpa ṭha tihzâwng leh a lâwmzâwng chu in ti a ni ang a, in thlahte leh nangni hian kumkhuain in ṭhatpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ Lalpa , in Pathianin, in va luhchhuah tûr hnamte chu a tihboral a, an ram in neih a, in luahsak hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a tihboral phahna ang thil kha in ti ve hauh tûr a ni lo; an biak pathiante chu zawng chhuakin, ‘Engtin nge an biak ṭhin le?’ tiin, an tih anga biak ve tum suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An pathiante an biak angin Lalpa in Pathian hi in be tûr a ni lo; Lalpa tenzâwng, thil chi tinrêng tih an chîng ṭhîn. An maichâmahte chuan an fanu leh fapate ngei pawh hâlral thilhlanah an hâl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi ti ngei ang che u; eng mah belh suh ula, eng mah hmaih bawk hek suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In zînga zâwlneiin emaw, mang neih chîngin emaw thil mak tak tak leh chhinchhiahna hrilh lâwk che u sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hrilh lâwk ang thil mak tak tak leh chhinchhiahna te chu thleng dik ṭhîn mah se, ngaihven suh u. ‘Ti rawh u, pathian dang biak tûr i zawng ang, in la hriat ngai lohte rawng i bâwl ang,’ ti mah se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chutianga ti zâwlnei leh mang neih chîngte thu chu bengkhawn suh ang che u; Lalpa in Pathian chu tihtakzet leh rilru zawng zawngin in hmangaih nge hmangaih lo tih Lalpa in Pathianin a fiahna che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hnung chu zui ula, a rawng chu bâwl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang zâwlnei leh mang neih chîngho chu in tihlum tûr a ni, Lalpa in Pathian, Aigupta ram aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u lakah an heltîr che u a, Lalpa in Pathianin awm dân tûr a kawhhmuh che u ata an pêntîr che u a ni, in zînga chutiang mi sual awm chu in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“In unau, in nu hrin ve ngeiin emaw, in fapain emaw, in fanuin emaw, in nupui pawm laiin emaw, in ṭhian bul berin emaw in nu leh in pate la hriat ngai loh pathian be tûra an thlêm che u chuan duh suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In bul hnaia chêngte pathian emaw, ram hla taka awmte pathian emaw, leia chêng rêng rêng mi dang pathian emaw be tûra an sâwm che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an thu chu ngaithla suh ula, ngaihven hek suh ang che u; anni chu khawngaih suh ula, lainat hek suh u, hum pawh tum hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûngho chu in tihlum tûr a ni, nangin kut i thlâk hmasa ang a, an chungah mipui an che ve dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawih in nihna Aigupta ram aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian laka pên botîr che u an tum avângin lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel mi zawng zawngin an hria ang a, an hlau vang; in zîngah chutiang thil sual chu a awm leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u khawpuiah te in awm hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />in zînga mi sual, tlâktlai lo tak takten an awmna khuaa mite chu in la biak ngai loh pathian be tûrin an thlêm thlu ta tih in hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in chhui ang a, ngun takin in zâwt vêl ang a, in zîngah chutiang thil tenawm ti chu an awm ngei a ni tih in hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chu khuaa mite chu khandaihin in that tûr a ni, a chhûnga mi zawng zawng leh an rante chu in that vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An thil neih zawng zawng in lâkte chu khawpui tual zau laiah in la khâwm ang a, an khua leh an sum in lâksakte chu in hâl vek tûr a ni; Lalpa tâna serh hran tawh chu tu man la suh se; Lalpa in Pathian tâna hâlral thilhlana hâl ral vek tûr a ni; chu khua chu thil chim chhe awm khâwm mai a ni kumkhua ang a, tu man an din leh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa tâna serh hran tawh chu tu man la suh se; tichuan, Lalpa thinur chu a dai ang a, a khawngaih ang che u a, in chungah ngil a nei ang a, in pate hnêna a tiam tawh angin a tipung leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian aw hi ngaithla ula, a thupêk ka hrilh che u hi zâwm ula, Lalpa in Pathian duhzâwng chu ti phawt mai teh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian mite in ni a, lu in sûnin inzai thi suh ula, in chalsam ziat kawlh ve hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawvêla awm zawng zawng zîngah nangni hi Lalpa in Pathian tâna hnam serh, a pual bîk atâna Lalpa thlan chhuah chu in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thil tenawm rêng rêng in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An sa in ei theih tûr rante chu hêngte hi a ni: bâwng, kêl leh berâm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakhi, sangai, sazuk, sathâr, saza, ramsial, ram berâm te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa tinrêng, a ke tin kâk phak leh chaw ṭhial nawn chi chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chaw ṭhial nawn a, tin kâk lo, tin kâka chaw ṭhial nawn lo sa chu in ei tûr a ni lo. Sanghâwngsei te, sazupui te, sangawi te hi in ei tûr a ni lo; chaw chu an ṭhial nawna, an tin a kâk lo a ni; in tân a bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawk hi a tin a kâk; mahse, chaw a ṭhial nawn lo va, a sa in ei tûr a ni lo, in tân a bawlhhlawh a ni. An sa in ei tûr a ni lo va, a thisâwn chu khawih pawh in khawih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuia awm hêngte hi in ei thei ang: phuhlip leh pângparh nei zawng zawng sa in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pângparh nei lo, phuhlip pawh nei lo sa chu in ei tûr a ni lo, in tân a tenawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sava ei thiang apiang chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêngte erawh hi chu in ei tûr a ni lo: mupui, lungdûp, muârla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mulukawlh, ngawihûp, mutê chi rêng rêng te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />choak chi rêng rêng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sava sâng vabak, tuifinriat sava mu chi rêng rêng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hrângkir, chhimbuk, chingpirinu, chhimbuksialki,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuivalawng, mulukawlh, luidung mu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kânghlai, dîl sava chi rêng rêng, chhuangtuar, bâk te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rannung thla nei, ke pali-a vâk chi rêng rêng chu in tân a bawlhhlawh a, ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlâwk thei chi sa thiang tawh phawt chu in ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Amaha thi chu eng sa mah in ei tûr a ni lo, in khaw chhûnga ram dang mi awm vete ei atân an hnênah in pe thei ang a, in hralh thei bawk ang. Lalpa in Pathian tâna inserh thianghlim tûr hnam in ni. Kêl notê chu a pui hnutein in chhûm tur a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“In lo rama thlai tharte chu sâwma pakhat kum tin dah hrang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûra a thlan hmunah chuan kalpui ula, a hmaah chuan in buh te, uain te, oliv hriak te; in bâwng leh berâmno hrin hmasak ber sâwma pakhat in pêkte chu ei ṭhîn ang che u. Lalpa in Pathian chu ṭih nachâng in lo hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In awmna chu a hlat hle a, Lalpa , in Pathian malsâwmna in dawn chu ken a harsat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hralh ula, a man chu têl ula, Lalpa in Pathianin a thlan hmunah chuan kalpui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu chuan bâwng te, berâm te, uain te, zu te, in châk zawng apiang lei ula, in chhûngkuain Lalpa in Pathian hmaah hlim leh lâwm takin ei ho ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In khuaa Levia chi awm vete chu in ngaihthah tûr a ni lo, in zîngah ram chanpual an nei ve lo a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Kum thum kuma in sâwma pakhat chu in awmna khuaa hmun pakhatah la khâwm ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ram chanpual an neih ve loh avângin Levia chite chuan chu chu an ei ang; mikhual te, fahrah leh hmeithai, in khaw chhûnga awmte pawhin an ei tûr a ni; puar takin an ei ve tûr a ni. Hetiang hian ti ula, Lalpa , in Pathian chuan in thiltih apiang a tihmuingîl ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kum sarih dan zêlah in leiba in ngaidam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetiang hi ngaihdam dân tûr chu a ni: Israel mi rêng rêngin a Israel-pui tangka pûktîr sela, a kum sarih tâwpah chuan a ngaidam tûr a ni, a tangka ba chu a ṭhîng tûr a ni lo; Lalpa ngeiin a ba chu a nuai bosak tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnam dangin in lei an bat chuan in ṭhîng thei ang; nangmahni miin in hnêna lei an bat chu in ṭhîng tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ramah chuan mal a sâwm dâwn che u avângin in zîngah tu mah rethei in awm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian aw chu ngaithla ula, vawiina ka hrilh che u, a thupêk zawng zawng hi zâwm phawt mai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian hian a tiam tawh angin mal a sâwm ang che u a, hnam tam tak in pûktîr ang a, nangni chuan in pûksak lo vang; hnam tam tak chungah thu in nei ang a, in chungah erawh chuan thu an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ramah chuan in khaw chhûnga awm ve, in chipui ngei tlachham lakah inchhungêng suh ula, ṭanpui hreh suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phal takin an mamawh zât zât chu pûktîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rilru sual pu suh ang che u, ‘Kum sarihna, leiba ngaihdamna hun a lo hnai ta si,’ tiin in unau rethei chu huphurhin melh suh ula, eng mah kawmpui suh ang che u; in chunga a vui thu Lalpa hnêna a sawi hlauh chuan thil sual ti in ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ui rilru chungin pe suh u, phal takin pe ula; chutianga in tih chuan Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kutkawih mal a sâwm ang a, in tih apiangah in hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In ramah rethei an awm reng dâwn a; chuvângin, thu ka pe a che u, in rama rethei te, tlachham te leh in unau te lakah thilphal hle rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“In Israel-pui, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw bawihah an rawn inhralh chuan, kum ruk in chhawr ang a, in chhuah tûr a ni. A kum sarihnaah chuan in zalêntîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutia in chhuahtîr chuan, kut ruakin in kaltîr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Berâm emaw, uain emaw Lalpa hnên aṭanga malsâwmna in dawn chu phal takin pe ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ramah khân bawih in nih kha hre reng rawh u; Lalpa in Pathianin bawih ata a chhuahtîr che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“In bawih chuan nangni leh in chhûngkua a ngainat che u avângin ‘Ka chhuak lo vang’ lo ti ta sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuti a nih chuan in kawngka bulah in dintîr ang a, a beng in verh ang a; tichuan, a dam chhûng chuan in bawih a ni tawh ang. In bawihnu pawh chutiang bawk chuan ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ui chungin in bawih chu chhuah suh u; in hna kum ruk a thawk tawh a, hlawhfa ruai ni ula in sum let hnih in sêng tawh ang. Chutiang chuan ti ula, kawng engkimah in Pathian chuan a tihmuingîl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“In bâwng leh berâmno hrin hmasak berte chu Lalpa in Pathian tân dah hrang ang che u. Bâwng chu chhawr suh ula, berâm pawh a hmul mêt hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum tin Lalpa hun ruatah chuan, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in chhûngkuain in ei ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kebai emaw, a mitdel emaw, hmêlhem nasa deuh emaw chu Lalpa in Pathian hnênah chuan in hlân tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In khaw chhûngah erawh chuan in ei thei ang, sakhi sa leh sazuk sa in ei angin mi thiangte leh bawlhhlawh lai te pawhin an ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thisen erawh chu in ei tûr a ni lo; tui angin leiah leihbaw rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Abib thla hian Lalpa , in Pathian chuan Aigupta ram aṭangin zânah a hruai chhuak che u a; Abib thla hian Lalpa in Pathian tân Kalhlên kût hi hmang ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hming awmna tûr Lalpa hmun thlanah chuan, in bâwng emaw, berâm emaw, kêl emaw Kalhlên kût atân Lalpa in Pathian hnênah hlân rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sa chu chhang dawidim telh nên in ei tûr a ni lo; Aigupta ram in chhuahsan dâwna hmanhmawh taka in ei ang khân tuarna entîrna chhang dawidim telh loh chu, ni sarih chhûng in ei tûr a ni. In dam chhûngin Aigupta, in retheihna ram in chhuahsan ni in hriat reng nân ei ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“In ram chhûngah rêng rêng ni sarih chhûng chu dawidim a awm tûr a ni lo. A ni hmasa ber tlaia in thilhlan, in ran talh in ei bâng sa a tûk atân dah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin luah tûra a pêk che u khaw chhûngah pawh Kalhlên kût sa hi in hlân tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûra a thlanah ngei chuan in Kalhlên kûtna tûr chu, tlai ni tlâk dâwn, Aigupta ram in chhuahsan hun angah khân in hlân ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian hmun ruatah chuan in chhûm ang a, in ei ang a, a tûk zîngah chuan in puan in lamah in haw leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng chu dawidim telh loh chhang in ei ang a, a ni sarih ni chuan Lalpa in Pathian tân inkhâwmpui urhsûn tak nei ula, chumi ni chuan hna rêng rêng thawk suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Favaha buh in hleh ṭan ni aṭangin hapta sarih chhiar ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tichuan, Pentikos kût chu hmang ang che u. Lalpa in Pathianin malsâwmna tam tak a vûr che u aṭangin amah chawimawi nân in thilthlâwn pêkte chu hlân rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan in fa te, in chhiahhlawh te, a hmei a pain in khuaa Levia chi te, hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te in zînga awm ve te nên chuan hlim takin Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûra a thlanah chuan ruai ṭheh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng thuruatte hi ngun takin zâwm ula, Aigupta ramah bawih in nih ṭhin kha hre reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Buh te in seng zawh vek a, in grepte in sâwr zawh vek hnuah, ni sarih chhûng Bâwkte kût hmang ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In fa te, in bawihnu leh bawihpa te, Levia chi te, ram dang mi awm ve te, fahrahte leh hmeithai, in khuaa awm te nên hlim takin ruai ṭheh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a hming awmna tûra a thlanah chuan ni sarih chhûng hmang ang che u. Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kutkawihte chu mal a sâwm a, a tihhmuingîl che u avângin in lâwm hle tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“In zînga mipa zawng zawng chu Lalpa in Pathian hmun thlanah chuan kum tin ṭum thum in lo kal ṭhîn tûr a ni: Kalhlên kûtah te, Pentikos kûtah te, Bâwkte kûtah te, Lalpa hmaah chuan eng mah keng lovin in lo kal tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi tinin Lalpa in Pathian malsâwmna in dawn ang zêlin in theih ang ang in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin khawpui a pêk che u apiangah rorêltu leh hotu tûrte ruat ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dik takin ro an rêl ang a, hleih an nei tûr a ni lo. Thamna an la tûr a ni lo, thamna hian mi fingte mit pawh a tidel ṭhîn a, mi dikte chungthu pawh dik lo takin a rêltîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eng lai pawhin a âwm tâwk tak leh dik takin thil ti ṭhîn ang che u; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u hi dam takin in luah reng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian maichâm in siamna bulah chuan Aseri lim, thing in phun tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian huatzâwng lung pawh in phun tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian hnênah hmêlhemna nei bâwng emaw, berâm emaw in hlân tûr a ni lo, a tenzâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin khua a pêk che u chhûngah rêng rêng chuan mipain emaw, hmeichhiain emaw in Pathian ngaimawh zawng tak tiin a thuthlung bawhchhiain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pathian dangte ûmin an rawng a bâwla, biak loh tûr ka tih - nî te, thla te leh thil dang tam tak te khi bia sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chutiang mi chu an awm tih in hriat chuan ngun takin in zâwt chhuak ang a, Israel-te zîngah chutiang thil tenawm ti in hriat chian chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kulh kawngkaah, chutiang mi, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw chu in rawn hruai ang a, chu mi chu lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuhretu pahnih tal thu avâng chauhvin in tihlum thei ang; mi pakhat thu avâng mai chuan in tihlum tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuhretute chuan lung chuan an dêng hmasa ang a, mipuiin an dêng ve chauh vang. Chutiang chuan in zînga thil ṭha lote chu in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mihring thah chu tihpalh a nih leh nih loh thu-ah te, rûkrûk leh rûk loh thu ah te, invuak palh leh palh loh thu-ah te dânin a huam loh tihthlûk harsa in khuaa in neih chuan, Lalpa in Pathianin a thlan hmunah chuan in kalpui tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levia chi, puithiamte leh chûng laia rorêltu tûra ruatte chu in râwn ang a, anni chuan a rêl dân tûr an hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa hmun thlan aṭanga tih dân tûr an hrilh che u ang ngei chuan in rêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hrilh che u ang ngei leh an thu tihthlûk ang chiah chuan in rêl ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Lalpa , in Pathian rawngbâwltu puithiam thu emaw, rorêltu tûra dah thu emaw duh lova tidanglam hlektu chu tihhlum tûr a ni, Israel ram chhûngah chutiang thil ṭha lo chu in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tinin an hria ang a, an hlau vang a, thil an ti mai mai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk tûr che u in thlena, in neiha, awmhmun in benbel hnu chuan, ‘Kan vêla hnamte angin lal i nei ve ang,’ in la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In lal tûr chu Lalpa in Pathian mi thlan ngei ni rawh se; nangmahni mi a ni ngei tûr a ni; hnam dang chu in lalah siam suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal chuan a sipaite tân sakawr a ngah viau tûr a ni lo, Aigupta ramah sakawr lei belh tûrin mi a tîr tûr a ni hek lo; Lalpa chuan ‘Chu lamah chuan in kîr leh tawh tûr a ni lo,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nupui pawh a nei ṭeuh tûr a ni lo, Pathian a hawisan phah ang e. Tangka leh rangkachak pawh a ngah viau tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A ram lalṭhutthlênga a ṭhut hun chuan Levia chi, puithiamhovin an kawl Dân bu hi a ziak chhâwntîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />chu chu a kawl ang a, a dam chhûngin a chhiar ṭhîn tûr a ni; hênga dânte leh thuruatte hi uluk takin a zâwm ang a, Lalpa a Pathian chu a chawimawi ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chipui Israel dangte aiin a indah sâng lo vang a, Lalpa thupêk pakhat tê pawh a namnûl lo vang a, rei tak a dam ang a, a thlahte pawhin Israel-te chungah ro an rêl reng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel-te zîngah Levia chi, puithiamte chuan ram chanpual an nei ve tûr a ni lo, Lalpa hnêna thil hlan hâl bâng chu an nei ang a, chu chu an chanpual tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam dangin ram chanpual an nei angin ram an nei ve tûr a ni lo, Lalpan a tiam angin an chanpual chu Lalpa chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Bâwng emaw, berâm emaw miin Lalpa hnêna an hlan apiang a dâr te, a khabe khing hnih te leh a pumpui te chu puithiam sa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In buh thar hmasa te leh in uain sâwr hmasak te leh in oliv hriak her chhuah hmasak ber te chu puithiam in pe tûr a ni; in berâm hmul meh hmasak ber pawh pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in zîng ata anni hi an thlah zêlte nên a hmaa ding a, a rawngbâwl tûrin kumkhua atân a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A duh phawt chuan Levia chi rêng rêng chu, khawii khua aṭang pawhin Lalpa hmun ruatah chuan a lo kal thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutah chuan Levia chi mi dangte ang bawkin Lalpa a Pathian rawng chu a bâwl ve thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiam dangte dawn ang ei tûr chu a dawng ve vek tûr a ni, ama chhûngten thil an rawn thawn erawh chu a nei bil thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram in thlen hunah, chuta lo awmte thil tenawm tih ang chu ti ve suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zînga tu mahin maichâma hâl ral tûrin in fate in hlân ve tûr a ni lo; aien te, ṭhumvâwr te, aisân te, dawi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kêl mei awrh te, ramhuaizâwl rawih te, thlarau zâwl te, mitthi thlûk te chîng ve suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang tih chîng chu Lalpa tenzâwng tak an ni; chuvâng alâwm Lalpa , in Pathianin hêng thil tenawm tih chîngte hi in hmaa a hnawh chhuah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian hmaah chuan hêng thil tenawm lakah hian in fihlîm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hêng hnam, in luhchhuah tûrte hian aisân an chîng a, ramhuaizâwl thu an ngaithla ṭhîn; nangni zawng Lalpa in Pathian hian chutiang in tih ve a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In zînga mi, keimah ang, zâwlnei a rawn pe ang che u, ani thu chu in zâwm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Horeb tlâng bula in pun khâwm ni khân Lalpa in Pathian hmaah, ‘ Lalpa kan Pathian aw chu hre tawh lo ila, a mei râpthlâk tak pawh chu hmu tawh lo ila, kan thi mai dâwn alâwm,’ tiin in ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘An sawi chu a dik e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An zînga mi ngei zâwlnei ka ruatsak ang a, an hnêna sawi tûr ka hrilh ang a, ka thupêk chu a hrilh chhâwng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hminga thu sawi ngaithla duh lo apiang chu keiman a chungthu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tirh ni si lova, ka hminga thu sawitu zâwlnei emaw, pathian dang hming sawitu zâwlnei emaw chu tihhlum tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘ Lalpa sawi a nih leh nih loh engtin nge kan hriat ang?’ in tih chuan, hei hi a thliar dân tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zâwlneiin Lalpa hminga thu a sawi chu a lo thlen lohva, a dik loh chuan, chu chu Lalpa hminga sawi a ni lo vang, ama duh thu-a sawi a ni, hlau suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In luahlan tûr hnamte chu Lalpa in Pathian chuan a tihborala, an ram chu in lâk a, an khuate in neih a, an inahte in chên hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram chu hmun thumah ṭhen ula, ram bung tinah, pan awlsam tûr, khaw pakhat ṭheuh ruat ang che u. Miin mihring tihlum sela, chûng khuaah chuan an tualtlân thei ang a, an lo hum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miin mahni hmêlma ni lo, mi dang that palh sela, chûng khuaah chuan an tlân ang a, an him thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pakhat chuan a ṭhian nên thing kit dûn sela, a hreipui fang chu chêk thlawnin, a ṭhianpa chu dêng hlum ta sela, hêng khaw eng berah hian emaw a tlân ang a, a him thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tualtlânna tûr khua chu a hlat viau chuan a tihhluma thisen phuba latu thinur ling chuan a ûm pha ang a, tûn hma pawha inhuatna nei lo thah ve kher loh tûr chu a that mai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, khaw pathum ruat tûrin ka ti che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chuan a tiam ang ngeia ram a pêk belh che u a, in pate hnêna pêk a tiam ram zawng zawng a pêk hunah che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khawpui pathum dang thlan belh leh ang che u. (Lalpa in Pathian chu in hmangaih takzeta, a thu anga awm in tum tlat a, vawiina ka hrilh che u zawng zawng hi in zawm phawt chuan ram chu a pe ngei dâwn si che u a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u-ah hian chutiang chuan ti ula, pawi khawih lo thisen chhuah suh u, a mawh in phurh loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Miin a hmêlma chu lo châng ruin lo beiin, lo tihlum ta sela; hêng tualtlânna khuaah hian tlân ve mah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chutiang thilah chuan ama awmna khaw upaten an ko ang a, a thaha laichîn hnai, thisen phuba latu tûr hnênah chuan an pe ang a, a lo tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawngaih hauh suh u, Israel-te zîngah tual thah tibo rawh u; tichuan, kawng engkimah in hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin ram hi a pêk lai che ua phun tawh, in ṭhenawmte ramri lung chu sawn suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thuhretu pakhat mai avângin mi an thil tihah thiam loh chantîr tûr a ni lo; mi pahnih pathum thu-a nemngheh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pakhatin mi dang tihchhiat tumin dâwtin hêk sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an pahnih chuan Lalpa hmun ruatah chuan an kal ang a, chuta puithiamte leh rorêltu tûra ruatte hmaah chuan an ding dûn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rorêltu chuan ngun takin a chhui ang a, a hêktu chuan dâwta hêk a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a hêka tihchhiat a tumna ang chiah chuan a hêktu chungah chuan an ti tûr a ni; chutiang thil ṭha lo chu in zîng ata in tibo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang ti ve lote chuan an hriatin an hlau ang a, chutiang thil ṭha lo chu in zînga tu mahin an ti ve dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In lainat tûr a ni lo, nun aiah nun, mit aiah mit, hâ aiah hâ, kut aiah kut, ke aiah ke a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Indo tûra in thawh chhuahin sakawr-tawlailîr te, sakawr te leh in aia tam sipai in hmuhin in hlau tûr a ni lo. Lalpa in Pathian, Aigupta ram aṭanga hruaichhuaktu che u chu in lamṭang a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmêlma bei tûra in chhuah dâwn hunah chuan puithiam lalber a lo kal ang a, mite chu a rawn fuih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Aw Israel-te u, hre rawh u, vawiin hian in hmêlma in do dâwn ta a, zâm suh ula, hlau hek suh u; thlaphâng suh ula, huphurh hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a awmpui che u a, a chhan him dâwn a che u,’ a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipui hotute chuan mite hnênah, ‘In thar sa, la hlân lo in awm em? A in lamah haw rawh se, indonaah a thi palh ang a, a in sak chu mi dangin an hlansak dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Grep phuna a rah la ei lo in awm em? A in lamah haw rawh se, a grep rah chu mi dangin an ei dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nupui huala, la nei si lo in awm em? Inah haw rawh se, chutilo chuan indonaah a thi hlauh ang a, mi dangin an neihsak dah ang e,’ an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan sipai hotute chuan, ‘Zâm leh hlau in awm em? In awm chuan in lamah haw mai rawh u, a sipaipuite rilru a tizâm dah ang e,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipai hotuten chutia an tih zawh hnu chuan sipai pâwl tin tân hruaitu ruat thliah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khawpui in beih dâwnin khuaa mite chu inpe tûrin ngên hmasa ṭhîn ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kulh kawngkhâr an lo hawnsak che u a, in hnêna inpe an nih chuan in bawihah an awm ang a, duh duhin in chhawr thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An inpêk duh lohva, indo an thlan chuan in hual tlat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin khua chu a lâktîr hunah che u chuan mipa zawng zawng chu that vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmeichhia te, naupang te, ran te leh khaw chhûnga thil dang te chu mahni tân in nei thei ang. In hmêlmate thil chu Lalpa in Pathian chuan a pe tawh che u a, in duh duhin in ti thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In luah tûr rama khawpui ni lo, ram pâwn daiha khawpuite in lâk hunah pawh chutiang chuan in sawisa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin in rochan atâna a pêk che u khawpuite in lâk hunah chuan, a chhûnga mi thaw thei tawh phawt chu pakhat mah zuah suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In that fai vek tûr a ni. Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Kanan mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te, Jebus mi te chu Lalpa in Pathian thupêk awihin that vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pathian biaknaa thil tenawm tak tak an tih ṭhinte chu an zirtîr loh nân che u, that ula, Lalpa in Pathian lakah thil sual in ti dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khua lâk in tum a, rei tak hual a ṭûl pawhin a vêla thei kûng chu kit suh ang che u. A rah chu in ei thei ang, a kûng erawh chu kit suh u, thingte chu in hmêlma an ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A rah ei theih a ni lo tih in hriat chian thing erawh chu in kit thei ang, hmêlma khua chu in lâk hma chuan in hmêlmate beihna hmanruaah in hmang thei ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram chhûngah mi ruang hmu ula, a thattu hre si lo ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />in hruaitute leh rorêltuten ruangin tu khua nge a hnaih ber tih an teh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnaih ber khaw hotute chuan bâwngla, la chhawr ngai loh, an thlang chhuak ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lui kang ngai lo bulah an kai chhuk ang a, lei la leh ngai lohvah, eng mah la chînna ngai lovah bâwngla ring chu an elhtliak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levia chi puithiam pawh an tel ve tûr a ni; tual thah thubuai rêng rêng hi a remtu tûr an ni si a. Lalpa in Pathianin ama rawngbâwltuah leh a hminga malsâwmna sawi ṭhîntuah a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tual thi ruang hnaih ber khaw upate chuan, lui kama bâwngla, a ring an elhtliah chungah chuan an kut an sil ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘He mi hi kan thah a ni lo va, a thattu pawh kan hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i mi Israel, Aigupta ram aṭanga i hruai chhuahte hi ngaidam teh. Ngaidam la, pawi khawih lote thisen mawh chu i mite phurhtîr suh ang che,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutia Lalpa tuk anga an tih chuan tual thah mawh chu in phur lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin indona a hnehtîr che u a, mi in man ṭeuhva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chûng zînga nula hmêlṭha in tih zâwng tak nupuia in duh in hmuh chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hâwn ula, an lu an ziat kawlh ang a, an tin an hlep vek bawk ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Man laia a kawr hâk chu an thlâk ang a, in inah chuan an awm reng tawh ang, thla khat chhûng chu an nu leh pate an hmuh tawh loh tûrte chu an sûn ang. Chumi hnu chuan nupuiah in nei thei ang a, in nupui an ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nupuia in duh loh leh chuan an duhna apiangah in kaltîr ang a, nupuia in neih tawh avângin, bawih angin in en tûr a ni tawh lo va, in hralh tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Miin nupui pahnih nei sela, fapa hrinsak ve ve sela; a nupui ngainat loh zâwka fa chu a ngainat zâwka fa ai chuan upa zâwk sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a fate hnêna ro a sem dâwn hunah, a nupui ngainat zâwk fa chu, duhsakin fa u chan a pe tûr a ni lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a fapa upa zâwk chu, a nupui ngainat zâwka fa ni lo mah sela, chan hnih a pe tûr a ni. Fa tîrte hi ngaih pawimawh tûr an ni a, dân ang taka an chanvo pêk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Miin fapa luhlul, tihmawh deuh mai nei sela, a nu leh a pate chuan hrem ṭhîn mah se, sâwt si lo sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a nu leh pate chuan an awmna khaw hotute ṭhu khâwm hmaah chuan an rawn hruai ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />upate hnênah chuan, ‘Kan fapa hi a luhlul a, mi ngawltâwt tak a ni, kan thu rêng rêng a awih duh lo va, zu leh sa ngawt a ngaihtuah mai,’ an ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuaa mi zawng zawng chuan lungin an dêng hlum tûr a ni; chutiang thil ṭha lo chu in zîng ata in thian fai vek tûr a ni. Israel mi zawng zawngin an hria ang a, an hlau ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Thil eng emaw a tihsual avânga tihhlum chu thinglêra khai a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a ruang chu a zânriak tûr a ni lo, a thih ni la lain phûm tûr a ni. Chutiang mi khai hlum chu Pathian ânchhe dawng a ni a, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram hi in tibawrhbâng tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“I chipui, Israel mi bâwng emaw, berâm emaw thlun chhuak i hmuh chuan hai der suh, khalh hâwnsak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A neitu chu khaw dang hla taka awm a nihin emaw, a neitu i hriat bawk si loh emaw chuan i inah kai haw ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sabengtung bo i hmuhin emaw, a puan hloh i chharin emaw, thil eng pawh, i unau Israel thil hloh i hmuh chuan, chutiang chuan ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“In unau Israel bâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw kawnga tlu i hmuh chuan haider suh, kaihthawhpui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hmeichhiain mipa thawmhnaw a inbel tûr a ni lo; mipain hmeichhe thawmhnaw a inbel tûr a ni hek lo; Lalpa in Pathianin chutiang chu a ten a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thingah emaw, leiah emaw sava bu awp lai, a tui keu tawh emaw, keu lo emaw i hmuh chuan a pui man suh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a notê chu i la thei ang, a pui erawh chu i chhuah tûr a ni; tichuan, i tân a ṭha ang a, i dam rei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“In i sak chuan chungzâwl khuaptu i siam tûr a ni; tichuan, tu emaw pawh tla palhin thi sela, a mawh i phur lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Grep huanah thei dang phun suh, i phun kawp chuan i grep rah pawh, i thil phun rah pawh Pathian tâna serh hran a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bâwngpa leh sabengtung lei rih duntîr suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />La leh sahmul kaih pawlh kawr ha suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I puan sin kil li-ah pehbuk siam ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Miin nupui a nei a, nakin deuhvah chuan a ning ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dâwt phuahchawpin thil ṭha lo pui pui a puh a, ‘nula thianghlim a nihna pawh ka hmu lo’ tiin a timualpho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang thilah chuan hmeichhe nu leh pate chuan an induh zâna an âwngphah thisen kai chu nula thianghlim ngei a ni tih fiah nân khaw upate hnênah an thlen tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmeichhe pa chuan upate hnênah, ‘He mi hi ka fanu ka neihtîr a, a duh leh ta si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dâwtin thil ṭha lo pui pui a puh a, ‘ka neih khân nula thianghlim a lo ni lo’ te a ti a. Kan fanu hi nula thianghlim ngei a ni tih fiah nân hei, an induh zâna an âwngphah thisen kai hi en teh u,’ a ti ang a; upaho hmaah chuan a phawrh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khaw upate chuan chu pa chu an vua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel nula thianghlim hming a tihchhiat avângin tangkaraw tlang za an chawitîr ang a, hmeichhe pa hnênah chuan an pe ang, a nupui a ni reng ang a, a dam chhûng chuan a ma thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu pa chuan thu dik a sawi a, nula thianghlim a nihna fiahna a awm loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a pa kawtah an hruai ang a, khuaa mite chuan lungin an dêng hlum tûr a ni. Israel mite zîngah thil tenawm tak a ti a ni, a pa ina a la awm lai, pasal a la neih hmain tlangvâl a lo nei a ni. Chutiang chuan Israel zîngah thil ṭha lo in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi dang nupui mutpuitu chu a hmeichhia nên an pahnihin tihhlum tûr an ni. Chutiang chuan Israel zîngah thil ṭha lo in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Nula thianghlim, pasal hual nei chu, khaw chhûngah miin a lo mutpui chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an pahnih chuan khaw kulh kawngka bulah in hruai ang a, lungin in dêng hlum tûr a ni; hmeichhia chu khaw chhûnga awm siin a au lo va, mipa pawh chu mi nupui hual a lo mutpui avângin den hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nula thianghlim pasal hual nei, ram hnuaiah miin lo sual sela, a mipa chauh chu den hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmeichhe chungah chuan kutthlâk tûr a ni lo, thihna khawp eng mah thil sual a ti lo; mi pakhatin mi dang a bei a, a that ta mai ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A mipa khân mi nupui hual ramhnuaiah a sual lui a, a hmeichhia chu au mah se tu mah chhan tûr an awm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Miin nula thianghlim, pasal hual la nei lo, sual sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mipa chuan hmeichhe pa hnênah nupui man pangngai tangkaraw tlang sawmnga a pe tûr a ni; a sual lui a, a nupui a ni nghâl ang. A dam chhûngin a ma thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tu man, mahni pa nupuite zînga mi mutpuiin a pa chu a timualpho tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tilmu keh emaw, zahmawh tan emaw chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sâwn chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo, a thlah, chhuan sâwmna pawh Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Amon mite leh Moab mite chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel tûr a ni lo; an mite chu chhuan sâwm pawh ral mah se, Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel hauh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata in lo chhuah khân ei tûr leh tuisik takngial pawh kengin an lo hmuak duh lo che u a; Mesopotamia ram, Pethor khaw mi Beora fapa Balaama kha ânchhe lawh tûr che uin an ruai zâwk a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan Balaama thu chu a bengkhawn duh lo va, Lalpa in Pathian hian a hmangaih êm che u avângin a ânchhia chu malsâwmnaah a chantîr ta hlauh va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chuvângin, eng lai mahin anni nên hian inremna siam suh ula, an hmuingîlna tûr pawh in dam chhûng chu eng mah tihsak suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Edom mite chu in ten tûr a ni lo, in unaute an ni; Aigupta mi pawh in ten tûr a ni lo, an ramah an lo mikhual che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An fa chhuan thumnate chu Lalpa mite pung khâwm zîngah an tel ve thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hmêlma do tûra in thawh chhuah a, bûka in riah khâwm chuan, thil ṭha lo tinrêng lakah in inthiarfihlîm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In muthilh hlânin in zînga mi tu pawh, a chi tla sela, riahhmun pâwnah nilêngin a awm tûr a ni; bûkah a lo lût tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlaiah a inbual ang a, ni a tlâk chuan bûkah a lo lût leh thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Riahhmun pâwnah daikalna tûr hmun bîk in nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil zum in keng ang a, chu chuan lei in cho khuar ang a, in vûr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“In bûkah chuan vêng tûr che u leh in hmêlmate hnehtîr tûr che uin Lalpa in Pathian chu a lo kal ve ṭhin avângin in bûk chu in vawng thianghlim tûr a ni, thil tenawm a hmuh hlauh chuan a kalsan mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A pu hnên ata bawih tlân bo chu in hnêna a lo tlân luh chuan tîr kîr suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In zîngah chuan awm ve sela, in khaw pakhat, a duhna berah awm ve rawh se, tinawmnah suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Israel mi tu mah, mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, Tempula nawhchizuarah an ṭang tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, an inzawrh hlawh chu intiamkam tlâkna atân Lalpa in Pathian inah ken luh tûr a ni lo; chutiang mite chu Lalpa in Pathian tenzâwng tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“In unau Israel-te hnênah tangka te, buh te leh thil dang rêng rêng, a pung neiin in pûktîr tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hnam dang chu a pung i ṭhîng thei ang, in unau Israel-te erawh chu a pung in ṭhîng tûr a ni lo; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u ramah in awm hunin in thil tih apiangah in hmuingîl thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian hnêna pêk in tiam tawh chuan, muang lovin pe thuai rawh u. Lalpa in Pathian chuan in tiam anga in tih a phût dâwn si a; chutilo chuan, thil sual ti in lo ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil pe tûra intiam loh hi sual a ni lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />in tiam vêk vêk si chuan in hlen ngei ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mi grep huana in kalin in duh tâwk in ei thei ang; amaherawhchu, pakhat mah in êmah in khung tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi buh ding lai lova in kalin an buh vui chu duh tâwk in thliak thei ang; amaherawhchu, favahin in hlep tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Miin nupui nei sela, nakin deuhvah a duh loh zâwng thil eng emaw a hmuh avângin duh leh ta lo sela, inmâkna lehkha a ziak ang a, a pe ang a, a in ata a chhuahtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu hmeichhia chuan pasal dang nei leh sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu mi pawh chuan duh lo leh ta se, inmâkna lehkha ziaksakin a in ata chhuahtîr ve leh sela; a nih loh leh, a pasal pahnihna chu a sûn pawh a ni thei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a enga pawh chu ni se, a pasal hmasa khân a nei leh tûr a ni lo; tihbawrhbânah a ngai tûr a ni; chutiang chu Lalpa tenzâwng tak a ni a, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ramah chutiang thil ṭha lo chu in ti tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nupui nei hlim chu indonaah a kal ve tûr a ni lo, vântlâng hnaah pawh phût tûr a ni lo; kum khat chhûng chu a nupui nên hlim takin an awm dûn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tu man chhangphut râwtna lung emaw, a chung zâwk chauh emaw pawh, thil pûk dahkhamah hrênsak suh u, an chhûng eizawnna in lâksak tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Israel miin Israel mi dang ruin bawihah chhawr sela emaw, salah emaw a hralh chuan chu mi chu tihhlum tûr a ni; chutiang chuan in zînga thil ṭha lo chu in thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Phâr natna in vei chuan Levia chi puithiamin tih tûr a tih chu ngun takin ti ula, an hnêna ka hrilh ang khân ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga in lo chhuah kawngah Miriami chunga Lalpa in Pathian thiltih kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“I ṭhenawm thil i pûktîrin a dahkham tûr, a in aṭangin va la suh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />pâwnah i ding ang a, i thil pûktu chuan a dahkham tûr chu a rawn la chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi rethei tak a nih chuan a puan dahkham chu mut nân hmansak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni a tlâk chuan i kîr leh tûr a ni; ama puan ngei chuan a intuam lum ang a, i chungah a lâwm bawk ang; Lalpa , in Pathian chuan thil ṭha ti-ah a lo pawmsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Mi rethei leh pachhia chu, nangmahni chipui a ni emaw, in khaw chhûnga awm ve hnam dang a ni emaw hna thawka in chhawr chuan tinawmnah suh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a tlâkbal êm avângin a hlawh chu a nî la lain, ni tlâk hma ngeiin in pe tûr a ni. In laka vuiin Lalpa hnênah a thlen hlauh ang a, thil sual ti in ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“An fate sualna avângin pate chu tihhlum tûr a ni lo; pate sualna avângin an fate pawh tihhlum tûr a ni hek lo; mi chu ama sualna avâng chauhvin tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In zînga awm ve hnam dang emaw, fahrah emaw chanvo chu tihheusak suh. Hmeithai puan chu dahkhamah lâksak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta ramah nangni pawh bawih in nih kha hre reng rawh u; Lalpa in Pathianin a tlan chhuak che u a nih kha; chuvângin, hêng thu hi ka pe che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Buh in sengin buhphal lâk hmaih in neih chuan vai leh tawh suh u; hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te chan ve tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathian chuan in kutkawih zawng zawngah mal a sâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In oliv rah, duh tâwka in sâwi ṭilh hnu chuan sawi ṭilh tum leh tawh suh u; hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te tân khêk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In grep rah in lawh pawhin in lawh hmaih chu vai leh tawh suh u, hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te tân zuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta ramah bawih in nih kha hre reng rawh u; chuvângin, hêng thu hi ka pe che u a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel mi, thubuai nei, rorêltu hmaa an inkhin chuan, pakhat zâwk chuan thiam a chang ang a, pakhat zâwk chuan a chang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thiam chang lo chu vuaka hrem tûr a nih chuan rorêltu chuan a hmuh ngeiah a thil sual tih phu tâwk a vuaktîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawi sawmli chin vuak theih a ni, a aia tam chu vuak tûr a ni lo; a aia tam in vuak chuan in unau chu in hmusit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bâwngpa buh i chîltîr laiin a hmui chu phuar suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Unauza chhûng khatah awm ho sela, pakhat chu fapa nei lovin thi sela, a nupui chu an chhûngkaw zînga mi ni lo, mi dang neihtîr tûr a ni lo. A pasala unau tu emaw chuan nupuiah a nei ang a, a unau thi ta ai kha a awh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fapa an neih hmasak ber chu a unaupa thi ta fapa anga ngaih tûr a ni ang a, Israel inthlah chhâwng hming chhiarnaah te a hming chu a bo bîk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thi ta-a unaupain a neih duh loh chuan, khaw hotute hnênah hmeichhia chu a kal ang a, ‘Ka pasala unau hian unaupa tih tûr, a unau thi ta thlah, Israel zînga an mang loh nân chi a thlahsak duh lo,’ a ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaw upate chuan an ko ang a, an lo sawipui ang a; a la duh chuan loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khaw hotute hmaah a pheikhawk pakhat chu hmeichhia chuan a hlihsak ang a, ‘Mahni unau chi thlahsak duh lo chu hetianga tih a ni ang’ a ti ang a, a hmaiah chil a chhâk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Chu mi thlahte chu Israel zîngah, ‘Pheikhawk hlihsak chhûng’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pa pahnih insual sela, pakhat nupui chuan a pasal chhan tumin a sualpuipa zahmawh pawhsak sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chu hmeichhia chu khawngaih hauh lovin a kut tansak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Bâwmah bûklung rit deuh leh zâng deuh kawl kawp suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tehna no lian deuh leh tê deuh pawh nei kawp suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bûklung dik tak, tehna no dik tak in hmang tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u-ah hian in dam rei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutianga thil dik lo tia mi bum chîngte chu Lalpa tenzâwng tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aigupta ram aṭanga in lo chhuaha, kawnga in awm laia Amalek-ho thil tih dân kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ṭihna rêng an nei lovin, in kal hah lai leh in chauh lai khân hnung lam aṭangin an rawn bei che u a; in zînga chau zual, hnufual deuhte chu an thah vek kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u-ah in hmêlmate laka râlmuang taka a awmtîr hunah che u chuan Amalek-ho hi in that fai vek tûr a ni, vân hnuaiah an sûlhnu hmuh tûr pakhat mah in zuah tûr a ni lo. Theihnghilh rêng rêng suh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk tûr che u in va thlen a, in hneha, awmhmun in benbel hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u a thil in thar hmasak ṭhenkhat chu êmah in dah ang a, Lalpa in Pathian hming awmna tûra a hmun thlanah chuan keng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuta puithiam lo awm hnênah chuan, ‘Kan pate hnêna Lalpa ram pêk tiam chu kan va luah ta tih vawiinah hian Lalpa i Pathian hmaah ka puang e,’ i ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puithiam chuan êm chu a la ang a, Lalpa in Pathian maichâm hmaah chuan a hûng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian hnênah hetiang hian in sawi bawk tûr a ni: ‘Ka pa chu mi vâkvai, Aram mi a ni a. Aigupta ramah a chhuk a, tah chuan a awm ta a; an la tlêm hle a; mahse, chutah chuan hnam ropui tak, chak tak leh rual tak an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta mite chuan bawihah min siam a, min tinawmnah a, min chhawr rethei êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , kan pate Pathian chu kan au ta a, Lalpa chuan a lo ngaithla a, min tihretheihzia te, kan rimzia te, min tihduhdahzia te chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram ata chu, a bân tha chak hmangin, thil mak leh chhinchhiahna râpthlâk tak tak a ti a, min hruai chhuak ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />khawizu leh hnutetui luanna ram hi min pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Lalpa i ram min pêka thar hmasa ber chu, hei, ka rawn kensak a che,’ i ti ang a; Lalpa i Pathian hmaah chuan i dah ang a, a hmaah chuan i kûn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathianin thil ṭha, nang leh i chhûngte a pêk avângin lâwmthu sawi la, in zînga awm leh Levia chiten lâwm takin in zâr zo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A kum thumnaah in thlai thar sâwma pakhat chu, in zînga awm Levia chi te, hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te pe ang che u; tichuan, khaw tinah ei tûr an nei ṭheuh dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutia in tih hnu chuan, ‘Thil serh, sâwma pakhat chu, ka inah tûnah pakhat mah ka kawl tawh lo; thu min pêk angin Levia chi te, hnam dang te, fahrah te, hmeithai te hnênah ka pe tawh a ni; sâwma pakhat pêk chungchânga i thupêk zawng zawng zawm loh rêng ka nei lo va, theihnghilh ka nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lusûn laiin pakhat mah ka ei lo va, mitthi chaw atân pakhat mah ka hlân hek lo; aw Lalpa , i thu ka awih a, sâwma pakhat pêk chungchânga i thupêk zawng zawng chu ka ti ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I vân hmun thianghlim aṭang chuan han thlîr thla la, i mi Israel-te hi mal han sâwm ang che. Min thlahtute hnêna pêk i tiam tawh ram, khawizu leh hnutetui luanna ram hi malsâwm ang che,’ in ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Vawiin hian Lalpa in Pathian chuan hêng thuruatte leh awm dân tûrte hi zâwm tûrin a tih che u hi. Rilru zawng zawngin, tihtakzetin zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vawiin hian Lalpa chu Pathianah in pawm ta a, a thuruat te, a thupêk leh awm dân tûr a tih te chu zâwma tih in tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vawiin hian Lalpa chuan a tiam angin a mi atân a pawm ta tak tak che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A siam, hnam dang zawng zawng aiin a tiropui che uin, fak in hlawh ang a, in hming a thang bawk ang a, miin an chawimawi ang che u, a tiam ang ngeiin Lalpa in Pathian tân hnam thianghlim in ni ang” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel upate nên mite hnênah, “Vawiina thupêk ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan lui in kân a, Lalpa , in Pathianin ram a pêk che u in va luh hunahin chuan lung hlai tak tak phun ang che u; chinaiin zût mâm ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tah chuan, hêng Dân zawng zawng hi ziak ang che u. Lalpa in Pathianin pêk a tiam che u, khawizu leh hnutetui luanna ram chu in luh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jordan thlang lam rala in awm hunah vawiina ka hrilh che u ang hian Ebal tlângah lung pathum phun ula, chinaiin zût mâm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thîra chher loh lungin maichâm siam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian tâna maichâm in siam rêng rêngin lung chher loh hman tûr a ni; chutah ngei chuan hâlral thilhlan chu in hâl tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Remna thilhlan pawh chutah chuan in hlân ang a, in ei tûr a ni, Lalpa hmaah chuan hlim takin awm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungphunah chuan hêng Dân thute hi in ziak tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan Levia thlah puithiamte nên Israel mi zawng zawng hnênah, “Aw, Israel-te u, in beng chhi ula, ka thu hi ngaithla teh u. Vawiin hian in Pathian, Lalpa mite in nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thu awih ula, a thuruat, vawiina ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi zâwm rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel-te chu thu a pe a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Jordan lui kai hnuah chuan mipuite malsâwm tûrin hêng hnam - Simeon-ho te, Levia chi te, Juda-ho te, Isakar-ho te leh Benjamin-ho te hi Gerizim tlângah an ding ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ânchhia puang chhuak tûrin hêng hnam: Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Aser-ho te, Zebulun-ho te, Dan-ho leh Naftali-ho te hi Ebal tlângah an ding tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng thu hi Levia chite chuan ring takin an sawi tûr a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Themthiam kut chhuak Lalpa tenzâwng milem chher chawp emaw, chhûn chawp emaw kawl ru a, chibai bûktu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawngin, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘A nu emaw, a pa emaw, zah lo chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Ṭhenawmte ramri lung sawntu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Kawng ni lova mitdel kaltîrtu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Hnam dang te, fahrah te leh hmeithai te laka hleih neih chîng chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Mahni pa nupuite zînga mi lo mutpui a, pate timualphotu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a. Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Ran pâwltu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Nu hrang emaw, pa hrang emaw pawh ni se, mahni farnu sualtu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Mahni pizawn mutpuitu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘A rûka tualthattu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Pawi khawih lo that tûra thamna latu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Hêng Dânte hi pawm ṭha duh lova, zâwm duh lotu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ an ti ang a, Mipui zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen’ tiin an lo chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian thu hi in awih a, a thupêk vawiina ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi in zawm thlap chuan khawvêla hnam dang zawng zawng aia ropuiin a siam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian thu chu awih phawt ula, hêng malsâwmna zawng zawng hi in dawng ang a, in dawng zui zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In lam leh ram lamah Pathianin mal a sâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Fanau malsâwmna in dawng ang a, in buhbâl a tihlâwk ang a, in ran vulhte a tihhmuingîlsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pathianin in êm te, in chawthlêng te mal a sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“In thiltih apiangah a tihmuingîl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“In hmêlmate nêna in inbeihin Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ang che u; a huhovin rawn bei che u mah sela, kil tinah an tlânchhia ang a, an darh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chuan in hnathawh apiang mal a sâwm ang a, in buh inte a tikhat ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin ram a pêk che u chu a tihhlâwksak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian thu hi in awih a, a thupêkte in zawm takzet chuan a tiam angin ama pual, a mi thianghlim atân a tinghet ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawvêla mi zawng zawngin Lalpa mi thlante in ni tih an hria ang a, an hlau ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In pate hnêna pêk a tiam ramah Lalpa chuan fa te, ran rual te, buhbâl te a neihtîr ṭeuh ṭeuh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a robâwm ata a hun takah ruah a rawn sûrtîr ang a, in thiltih mal a sâwm ang a, hnam tinrêng in thil neih in pûktîr ang a; an thil erawh chu in pûk a ngai ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan hnam dangte zuitu ni lovin, an hruaituah a siam ang che u; a thupêk vawiina ka pêk che u hi rinawm taka in zawm phawt chuan in lo hmuingîl ang a, in hlawhchham ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engti kawng mahin in bawhchhe tûr a ni lo va, pathian dangte biain an rawng in bâwl tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian thu in awih lohva, a thupêkte leh a thuruatte vawiina ka hrilh che u hi in zawm duh lohva, in tih duh hek loh chuan hêng thil ṭha lo hi in chungah a thleng ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“In lam leh ram lamah chhiatna in tâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan in êm leh in chawthlêng a leihbuaksak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan ânchhia a lawh ang chia, fa thu-ah te, buhbâl thu-ah te, ran vulh thu-ah te in hmuingîl lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“In thiltih apiangah in hlawhchham ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Thil in tihsual a Lalpa in kalsan chuan ânchhia in dawng ang a, in hnathawh rêng rêngah in hmuingîl lo vang a, in buaiin in beidawng ang a, rang takin in chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“In ram neih tûrah chuan vânduaina hlîrin a tlâkbuak ang che u a, dam khawchhuak tu mah in awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hri a veitîr ang che u a, khawsikpui te in vei ang a, in vûng bawk ang. Khua a tikhêng ang a, in thlai te a tiro bawk ang a, in thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruah rêng a sûr lo vang a, in lote chu thîr angin a châr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In lovah lei dip leh vaivut a sûrtîr ang a, a rawn tichhe vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan in hmêlmate chu hnehtu zâwkah a ṭantîr ang a, a huhovin bei mah ula, kil tinah in tlânchhia ang a, in darh vek ang. Khawvêla mi zawng zawngin in chunga thil thleng chu râpthlâk an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In thih hunah in sa chu sava leh ramsaten an rawn tlân ang a, tu mah lo hnawttu an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aigupta-ho vei ang dam thei lo khawihli te, ngâwt te, pânchhia te, uithak te Lalpa chuan a veitîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a ti-â ang che u a, in mit a tidel ang a, a timangang hle ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mitdel angin chhûn êngah pawh in dap dun dun ang; in thil tih rêng rêngah in hmuingîl lo vang a, an tirethei hle ang che u, an tichêp hle ang che u; an rawk fo ang che u a, chhantu rêng in nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Nupui in hual ang a, mi dangin an nei hlauh vang; in in sa ang a, in luah lo vang; grep huan in siam ang a, a rah in ei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In bâwngpa chu an talh ang a, a sa pawh in ei ve lo vang; in hmuh lai ngeiin in sabengtung chu an lâksak ang che u, tu man an chhan lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In fanu in fapate chu in hmuh lai ngeiin hnam dang bawihah an pe ang a; ni tin anmahni ngaiin in thlîr ang a, in mit a vai zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hah taka in thlawh chhuah chu in hriat ngai loh hnam dangin an rawn lâksak ang che u; a manah tihduhdah leh chêksawlh mai lo chu eng mah in têl lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In thil hmuhte chu in ât phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpa chuan in ke-ah pân dam thei lo a veitîr ang che u a, kephah aṭanga in chhîp thlengin khawihli in vei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan in lalte nên, hnam dang ram, in pi pute la awm ngai lohna ramah chuan salah a hruai ang che u; chûng ramah chuan thing leh lunga siam pathiante in bia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa tihdarhna che u ramah chuan a hmu apiang che u chuan in chunga thil thleng chu mak an ti ang a, an hmusit ang che u a, nuihza siam nân an hmang ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Thlai chi in chîng ṭeuh ang a, tlêm tê chauh in seng si ang; khauvin a ei zawhsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Grep huan in siam duai ang a, ngun takin in enkawl ang a; mahse, a rah lawh tûr emaw, uain in tûr emaw in hmu lo vang a, a ngêt zo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />In ram pumah oliv thing awm chûk mah se, a hriak thih tûr pawh in nei lo vang, a hlamtla zo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Fanu fapa in ngah hle ang a, an tha in chhawr si lo vang, salah an awm vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />In thei kûng leh thlai dangte chu khauvin a ei kawlh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“In zînga hnam dang awm vete chu an lal tual tual ang a, nangni chan erawh chu a chau tial tial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tangka an pûktîr ang che u a, nangni chuan pûktîr tûr tangka in nei ve lo vang. A tâwpah chuan in pute an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian thu in awih lohva, a thupêk leh a thuruat an hrilh che u kha in zawm lohva, in tih duh loh chuan hêng thil ṭha lo zawng zawng hian a tlâkbuak ang che u, in tuar zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In chungah leh in fate chungah Pathian a lungawi lo tih in hriat theih nân chhinchhiahna a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />malsâwmna tinrêngin a vûr che u a, hlim leh lâwm taka Lalpa , in Pathian rawng chu bâwl tûr in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Rilṭâm leh tuihâlin, saruak leh engkim tlachhamin Lalpa tirh, in hmêlmate rawng chu in bâwl ang a, in chauh dêr thlengin in nghâwngah thîr nghâwngkawl an bahtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“An ṭawng pawh in hriat ngai loh mi râwng pui pui, kâwlkil aṭangin Lalpa chuan a rawn beihtîr ang che u, mu angin an lo bir thut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Naupang pawh, tar pawh, tu mah rêng an khawngaih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />In ran te, in thlaite an ei zo vang a, rilṭâmin in thi ang; in buh te, in uain te, in oliv hriak te, in ran te an zuah lo vang; rilṭâmin in thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u rama in chênna khua zawng zawng an bei ang a, in kulh sâng tak tak, nghet in tih êm êmte chu an tichim vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“In hmêlmaten in kulhte an hual hunah chuan in ril a ṭâm khawp ang a, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u in fate sa in ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Mi ṭha leh mi neinung ber ṭhîn, eng mah ren nei ngai lo chuan a unaupa emaw, a nupui pawm lai ngei emaw, a fa la dam chhunte emaw pawh ei tûr pe phal lovin a rûkin a ei duh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />hmêlmaten in khua an hual rei êm avângin ei tûr a nei lo mangangin a fate sa ngei a ei ang a, mi dang a pe ve phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hausanu, lei pawh rap ngai lo, ngilnei tak tak ṭhînte pawhin an pasalte, an fanu leh fapate hriat lohvin a rûkin an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hmêlmaten an hual rei êm avângin eng mah ei tûr a awm tawh lo vang a, an rilṭâm mangangin an nau hrin leh an chhûl chu a rûkin an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“He lehkhabua ziak Dân thu chuang zawng zawng hi ṭha taka in zawm lohva, in tih duh lohva, Lalpa hming ropui tak leh hlauhawm tak hi in chawimawi duh loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />in thlahte nên tihdam theih loh hri a veitîr ang che u a, in pûl puk puk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Aigupta rama an vei ang hri hlauhawm tak tak in hmuh kha a veitîr ang che u a, in dam khawchhuak tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />He Dân lehkhabua chuang tel lo, natna chi hrang hrang Lalpa chuan a veitîr bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian thu in zawm loh chuan vâna arsi zâtin tam mah ula, dam chhuak in awm pheuh pheuh lek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thil ṭha tihsak che u leh tihpunsak che u a châk ṭhîn; chutiang bawkin tihchhiata tihhlum che u a châk dâwn a ni. In luah tûr ram aṭang hian a la chhuak dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan khawvêl pum puiah, hnam tin zîngah a tidarh ang che u; chûngah chuan thinga siam leh lunga siam pathiante chibai in bûk ang a, in pi pute pawhin an biak ngai lohte chu in be dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Khawiah mah râlmuang taka awm hle hle theihna hmun in nei lo vang. Lalpa chuan a tithlaphâng reng ang che u a, in beidawngin in beisei a bo hial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Thih hlau rêng rêngin in awm ang a, a chhun a zânin thlabâr takin in awm ang a, in dam khawchhuak dâwn nge dâwn lo pawh in hre lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />In thil hlauh leh in mita hlauhawm in hmuhte avâng chuan zîngah, ‘Tlai ni tawh se,’ in ti ang a, zânah chuan, ‘Khua vâr tawh mai se,’ in ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta ramah lawngin a tawlh thla ang che u; in chhuk leh tawh lo vang, ka ti na a; mahse, in chhuk ang a, in hmêlmate lei tûrin bawihpa emaw, bawihnu atân emaw in inzuar ang a; mahse, tu man an lei duh lo vang che u.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah Israel-te nên Moab ramah hetianga thu thlung tûr hian a hrilh a; Horeb tlânga a thuthlung belhchhahna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chu pung khâwm tûrin a hrilh a, an hnênah, “In mit ngeiin Aigupta lal Farawa leh a ṭhuihruaite leh an ram chhûnga Lalpa thiltih kha in hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hri hlauhawm pui pui te, thil mak tak takte leh thil ropui tak tak a tihte kha in hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vawiin thlengin in thil hmuhte kha a ngaihna in hre lo va, a awmzia tak in la hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng Lalpa chuan thlalêrah a vahvaihtîr che u a; mahse, in kawrte leh in pheikhawkte chu a hlui chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chaw pângngai ei tûr nei lovin, uain leh zu in tûr pawh in nei lo va; mahse, Lalpa chuan ei tûr a tumsak che u a ni; Lalpa hi in Pathian chu a ni tih in zir theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />He hmun in lo thlen khân Hesbon lal Sihona leh Basan lal Oga chuan min lo bei a, kan hneh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an ram pawh kan neihsak a; Reubena thlah te, Gada thlah te leh Manasea thlah zatve te chu an chanpualah kan pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, he thuthlung thute hi zâwm ula, in thil tih apianga in hmuingîl theih nân ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Vawiin hian Lalpa in Pathian hmaah in hruaitu te, in hotu te, in mipa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />in hmeichhia te, in fa te, in zînga awm ve hnam dang te, thing phura tuichawisaktu che u te nên in vaiin in ding a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vawiin hian Lalpa in Pathian chuan thu a thlunpui dâwn che u a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tichuan, Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna thu a tiam angin a mite atân a tinghet ang che u a, in Pathian a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nangni nên chauh he thuthlung hi a siam a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vawiina heta dingte tân mai ni lovin kan thlah lo la piang tûrte tân pawh he thuthlung hi a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Aigupta rama kan awm laia kan nun dân kha in hria e, kan lo chhuah kawnga hnam dang lo awmte khawsak dân te in hria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thingtum te, lungtum te, tangkarua leh rangkachaka siam milem tenawm tak tak te an bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, chhûngkua emaw, hnam pum emaw pawhin, Lalpa kan Pathian hawisanin hêng hnam dang pathiante hi in be hlauh dah ang e, thil zung chawr, tûr kha tak paia ṭhang lian ta ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Vawiina thu urhsûn tak tak kan ngaihthlâk hi kan zînga ngaithla vetu tu mahin, ‘Luhlul taka mahni duh ang anga awm pawh a pawi lo a nih chu,’ ti rilru suh se; chumi avâng chuan mi sual emaw, mi ṭha emaw in boral vek mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang mi chu Lalpan a ngaidam lo vang, a chungah Lalpa thinur chu a alh zâwk ang. He lehkhabua ziak thil ṭha lo zawng zawngte hian a tlâkbuak ang a, Lalpa chuan a tiboral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Dân bu thuthlung ziaknaa ânchhe dawn tûr chuang zawng zawng chhiatna chu a chungah a thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Rei fe hnuah chuan, in thlahte leh hnam dangte, ram hla tak taka awmte chuan in rama chhiatna leh tuarna; Lalpa thlentîr chu an hmu ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />in lote chu ram ṭiau, kât leh chi tamna ram a ni ang a, eng mah phun theih a ni lo vang, hnim takngial pawh a ṭo thei lo vang. In ram chu Sodom leh Gomora te, Adma leh Zeboim te, Lalpan thinur taka a tihchhiat tak khuate ang kha a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khawvêla mi zawng zawngin, ‘ Lalpa hian engtiziaa he ram hi heti taka sawisa nge maw a nih le? Eng nge chuti taka a thinur chhan?’ an ti huai huai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hetiang hian an chhâng ang: ‘An thlahtute Pathian chuan Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah lai khân thuthlung a siampui a, Lalpa mite chuan chu chu an bawhchhia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tûn hmaa an biak ngai loh hnam dang pathian, Lalpan biak a khapte chu an be ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chuvângin, Lalpa chu a mite chungah a thinur a, he lehkhabua chhiatna ziak zawng zawngte hi an ramah a thlentîr ta a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a thinur êm avângin a hnawt chhuak a, hnam dang ramah an awm ta daih a ni,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian hian thurûk ṭhenkhat chu a puang lo; amaherawhchu, a Dân chu a rawn puang a, kan thlahte nên chu chu kan zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Malsâwmna dawn nge in duh ânchhia, in thlan tûr ka siamsak che u a ni. Lalpa chuan in chungah hêng thil ṭha lote hi a thlentîr a, a hnawhchhuahna che u hnam dang rama in awm hunah duh thlang thei in nih kha hre reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In thlahte nên Lalpa lam in lo hawi leh a, vawiina ka hrilh che u, a thupêkte hi tihtakzeta in awih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in chungah ngil a nei leh ang a, hnam hrang hrang zînga a tihdarhna che u ram aṭangin a rawn hruai kîr leh ang che u a, a tihmuingîl leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawvêl ram hla berah kal daih mah ula, Lalpa in Pathian chuan a hruai khâwm leh ang che u a, a rawn hruai kîr leh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tichuan, in pi leh pute awmna ṭhin ram chu in nei leh ang a, in thlahtute ai khân in tam zâwk ang a, in neinung zâwk bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in thlahte nên thu awih theihna thinlung a pe ang che u a; tichuan, ani chu tihtakzetin in hmangaih ang a, chu ramah chuan in awm reng thei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng ânchhia zawng zawng hi in hmêlma, nangmahni hawtu leh tiduhdahtute hi a dawntîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a thu in awih tawh ang a, vawiina a thupêk ka hrilh zawng zawng che u hi in zâwm tawh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan in thiltih apiangah a tihmuingîl ang che u a, fate in ngah ang a, in ran vulhte nasa takin a pung ang; in lote chu a hlâwk êm êm ang. In pi leh pute tihhmuingîl a châk ang bawk khân nangni pawh tihhmuingîl che u a châk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thu erawh chu in zâwm thlap tûr a ni a, a Dân bu-a chuang thuruat leh thupêk zawng zawng chu in awih vek tûr a ni a, tihtak meuhvin a lam in hawi bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Vawiina thu ka pêk che u hi in tân zawm har lutuk a ni lo va, hriat phâk loh tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘A thu kan hriat a kan zawm tûrin tu nge vânah han lâwn ang a min rawn lâksak ang?’ tih tûrin vâna awm daih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Kan hriata kan zawm tûrin tu nge tuifinriat râlah kal ang a min rawn lâksak ang?’ tih tûra tuifinriat râl daiha awm a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu chu hetah, i bula hi a awm reng alâwm, i hriat fo tawh, sawi pawh i sawi fo ṭhin kha a ni a, zâwm mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Vawiin hian eng nge in thlan duh, thil ṭha nge thil ṭha lo, nun nge thih, thlang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian thupêk vawiina ka hrilh che u hi in awih a, ani chu in hmangaih a, a thu in ngaihthlâk a, a dânte in zawm chuan in hmuingîl ang a, hnam ropui tak in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thu in awih lohva, in ngaihthlâk duh lohva, pathian dangte in biak phawt chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chiang takin ka hrilh a che u: in boral ngei ang; Jordan râl, in luah tûr ramah chuan in dam rei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vawiinah hian nunna nge in duh thihna, Pathian malsâwm dawn nge in duh ânchhia, a eng zâwk nge in thlan, hretuah lei leh vân ka sâwm e. Nangmahni leh in thlahte in dam zêl theih nân nunna thlang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chu hmangaih ula, a thu awih ula, amah chu vuan tlat rawh u; tichuan, in thlahtu Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna pêk a tiam ramah chuan in thlahte nên in dam rei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel mite hnênah thu a sawi zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kum za leh sawmhniha upa ka ni ta a, duh duha chhuakvâk thei pawh ka ni ta lo; Lalpa chuan ‘Jordan lui i kân ve dâwn lo,’ min ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathian chuan in hma a hruai zêl dâwn a, chûnga hnam awmte chu a tihboralsak ang che u; in luahlân dâwn a ni; Lalpa sawi tawh angin Josua hian a ho ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Amor-ho lal Sihona te, Oga te leh an ram te a tichhia a, an mite a tihhlum vek ang khân anni pawh a tiboral ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan anni chu a pe ang che u, thu ka pêk che u ang tak hian in tiboral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Intipaukhauh ula, ṭang sauh sauh rawh u; hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u; anni chu huphurh hek suh u; amah Lalpa , in Pathian ngei chuan a kalpui zêl ang che u a, a thlahthlamin a kalsan hek lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josua chu Mosian a ko va, Israel mi zawng zawng hriatah, “Intipaukhauh la, ṭang nasa rawh, an pate hnêna pêk Lalpa tiam ramah chuan Israel mite hi i hruai lût ang a, i luahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah ngei, Lalpa chuan a kalpui dâwn che u a, a awmpui zêl ang che u; a thlahthlam lo vang che u a, a kalsan bawk hek lo vang che u, hlau suh ula, zâm hek suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan he Pathian Dân hi lehkhabu-ah a ziak a, Levia chi, Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu puithiamte chu a pe a, Israel upate pawh a pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia chuan an hnênah, “Kum sarihna tâwp, leiba ngaihdamna hun ruat apiangah Bâwkte kût laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-ho chu Lalpa in Pathian hmun ruatah a hmaah an rawn inlan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipui khâwm ula, Lalpa , in Pathian ṭih nachâng an hriat a, ka dân bu-a thu chuang zawng zawng hi an zawm theih nân paho te, nuho te, naupang te leh hnam dang in khuaa awm te chuan ngaithla rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Lalpa in Pathian dân la hre ve lo, in thlahte pawhin an hre ve ang a, Jordan lui kâna in luah tûr rama in awm chhûng zawng chu Lalpa in Pathian ṭih nachâng an hre ve dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “I dam rei dâwn tawh lo; Josua ko la, Inbiakna bûkah rawn hruai rawh, a tih tûr ka lo hrilh ang e,” a ti a. Mosia leh Josua chu Inbiakna bûkah chuan an kal a, an va inlan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chu Inbiakna bûkah chuan chhûm dingin a lo lang a, bûk kawngkaah chuan chhûm chu a ding luah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, i pi leh pu hnênah i mu ve thuai dâwn ta; hêng mite hian i thih hnu chuan min uiresan ang a, thu ka thlunpuite kha an bawhchhia ang a, min kalsan ang a; an va chênna tûra lo awm hnam dangte pathian chu min biaksan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An chungah ka thin a rim ang a, ka kalsan ang a, an chhe vek ang. Thil ṭha lo pui puiin a tlâkbuak ang a; kei an Pathianin ka awmpui tawh loh avângin hêng thil hi an tuar a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tak an ti a, Pathian dang an biak tâk avângin an lakah ka hmêl ka thup daih dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chuvângin, he hla hi ziak chhuak la, Israel mite chu zirtîr rawh; an chunga ka lungnih lohzia an hriatna tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An thlahtute hnêna pêk ka tiam, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram chu ka hruai thleng ngei ang. Amaherawhchu, duh tâwk tâwk ei tûr an neia an thau mûm tul hunah chuan, pathian dangte lam an hawiin chibai an bûk ang a; min hmusitin ka thuthlungte chu an bawhchhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk tak takin a tlâkbuak hnuah pawh he hla hi an fate pawhin an la chham thei zêl ang a, chu chuan an sualzia a hriattîr ang. Pêk ka tiam ka hruai thlen hma pawh hian, an rilru put dân chu ka hre reng alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi ni ngei chuan Mosia chuan hla chu a ziak chhuak a, Israel-te chu a zirtîr ta tlut tlut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Nuna fapa Josua hnênah, “Intipaukhauh la, ṭang nasa rawh, Israel mite hi pêk ka tiam ramah chuan hruai ang che, ka awmpui zêl nâng che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia chuan Pathian Dân chu lehkhabu-ah kimchang takin a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ziak zawh chuan Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu Levia chite chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“He Dân bu hi la ula, Lalpa in Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm bulah dah rawh u, in awm dân tehna-ah a ṭang dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In tihmawhzia leh in luhlulzia ka hria, kei ka la dam lai ngei pawhin Lalpa lakah in nuar a, ka thih hnu phei chuan eng ang takin awm ang che u maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />In upate leh in hruaitute chu lo pung khâwm sela, hêng hi ka lo hrilh ang e; lei leh vân ka thuhretu atân ka koh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thih hnu chuan in che khawlo hle ang a, ka thu zirtîr che u kha in zâwm duh lo vang. Nakin deuhvah phei chuan Lalpa khap chu in ti lui ang a, a thin in tiur ang a, in boral mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosia chuan he hla hi a sawi chhuak a, Israel mi zawng zawng chuan an ngaithla ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vânte u, ka thu hi bengkhawn ula, leilung pawh hian ka thu hi ngaithla rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka zirtîrna hi ruah angin a sûr ang a, ka thu hi dai angin a tla ang. Hlobet chunga ruah si tla, thlai chawrno nan seng seng ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa hming chu ka puang ang a, Kan Pathian chu chawimawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkim ṭha taka titu, Lungpui a ni, Dik takin ro a rêl ṭhîn, Pathian rinawm, khawlohna nei lo, Thil ṭha leh dik ti ṭhîntu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawlohna a nei em ni? Nei suh e, A fate a ni demawm chu, Chhuan bengtla lo leh tihmawhte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi â leh mi chhâwte u, hetiang hian em ni Lalpa in thungrulh dâwn? A hringtu che u, in pa a ni, a siam che u a, a tipuitling che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûn hma kha ngaihtuah chhuak teh u, Hun liam daih tawhte kha, Eng thil nge thleng in pate zâwt ula, Hmânlai lal chanchin in upate sawitîr teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chungnungberan hnamte ram a sem a, Mite awmna tûr a ruatsak lai khân, Pathian fate zâtin an ramri a khamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chanpual atân Jakoba thlahte a thlang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlalêra an vâkvai a hmu a, Ram ṭiau, thlichhe tlehnaah chuan A hliahkhuh a, a duat hle a, A mitnautê angin a vêng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mupuiin a bu a thai darh a, A note vilin a thlâwk vut vut a; A thla zârin a dâwm a dâwm a, A thlawhpui ṭhîn ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chauh chu an hruaitu a ni a, Hnam dang pathian an tel ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlângramah a chuanchhuahtîr a, Rama thil ṭote chu an ei a, Lung kârah khawizu an la a, Lung hmunah pawh an oliv a rah tiar tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnutetui an ngah, an bâwngte leh kêlte nên; An berâmte lah an thau, Basan ram berâm leh kêlchal ang, Buh tui ber leh uain ṭha ber an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te chu an lo hausa a, An induh ta hle a, An thau mûm tûl a, Siamtu, an Pathian chu an kalsan a, Chhandamtu, an Lungpui chu an ngainêp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milem an bia chu a haw êm êm a, Thil tenawm an tihte chuan a tithinur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ni lo, ramhuai an bia a, An pate hriat ngai loh leh hlauh ngai loh An be ta, pathian tharlâm tê tê chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anmahni hringtu Lungpui chu an pawisa lo va, Anmahni siamtu Pathian chu an kalsan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hmuhin a thin a ur a, A fanaute chu a hnâwl ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Ka bîkbosan ang a, Engtin nge an awm dâwn ka thlîr teh ang, Chhuan tihmawh tak leh Fa sual rin tlâk loh tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian ni hlei lo an bia, Ka thîkthu an chawk tho va, An milemte chuan min tithinur. Chî anî-a chhiar tham lohte ka thîktîr ang, Hnam â takte hmangin ka tithinur bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thinur chu mei angin a alh ang a, Leia thil zawng zawng a kâng ral ang. Seol pawh a kâng thleng ang a, Tlâng nghahchhante a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chhiatna tinrêng an chungah ka thlentîr ang a, Thalin ka kâp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rilṭâm khawsikin an thi ang a, Hri râpthlâk tak tak an vei ang. Ram sakawlhten an seh ang a, Vaivuta tleng rûl tûr neiten an chu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuallaiah khandaih an tawng ang a, In chhûngah thil râpthlâk tak tak nên, Nula tlangvâl, ṭhalai an that ang a, Naupang pawh, tar pawh an zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu ma hriat tawh loh tûrin Tihmang dêr ka tum hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mahse, an hmêlmaten uangthuang takin, ‘A mite chu kan sawisa nek,’ an tih ka hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hnam â tak zawng an lo ni, Thil rêng an hrethiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Fing deuh se chu an hrethiam tûr An awm dân tûr an thlîr thiam ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An Lungpui chuan kalsan lo se, An Pathian, Lalpa chuan thlauhthla lovin, Pakhatin sâng têl a ûm dâwn em ni? Pahnih lekin sîng têl an ngam ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An hmêlmate pawhin an pathian chu Israel-te Pathian ai chuan a nêp zâwk tih an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An hmêlmate chu Sodom leh Gomora anga sual, Grep kha, tûr nei ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An uain pawh chu rûl tûr ang, Rûl chuk anga hlauhawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa chuan an hmêlmate thil tih chu a hre reng a, Phuba lâk hun remchâng a zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An ke rah chu a tleu hunah, Phuba ka la ang a, ka thungrûl ang, An chhiat hun chu a lo hnai ta; An chunga lo thleng tûr chu an tuar thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite a chhan ang a, A chhiahhlawhte chan chauhzia te, Bawih leh bawih lo te pawh; Thi bâng tlêmzia a hmuhin a lainat ang a, A chhan chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A mite chu, ‘In pathian thiltithei, In rin ṭhinte chu khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />In thilhlante chuan in châwm a, Uain in tûr nên lam in chhawpsak kha? Lo kal sela, chhan che u rawh se, Lo tlân sela, hum che u rawh se,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keimah chauh hi Pathian chu ka ni. An awm tak tak lo, pathian dang zawng, Ka tihlum a, ka tinung a, Ka hliam a, ka tidam a, Ka ta min chhuhsak thei tu mah an awm hlei nem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathian nung ka nih hi, Bân pharin thu ka tiam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khandaih ka tât hriam ang a, Dik takin ro ka rêl ang. Ka hmêlmate chungah phuba ka la ang a, Min hawtute chu ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />An thisen chu ka thalah a luang ang a, Ka khandaih chuan thisen a chhuah ang a, Hmêlma sam sei tak takte chu a sât hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hnam tinte u, Lalpa mite hi fak rawh u, Anni thattute chu a hrem zêl a, A hmêlmate chungah phuba a la, A mite sual a ngaidam ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mosia leh Nuna fapa Josua chuan chu hla chu mipui hriatah an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mosian hêng thu hi Israel mite hnêna a sawi zawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />‘Hêng, thu ka pêk zawng zawng che u hi ngaihtuah ngun ula, hêng dân thute hi zâwm tûrin in fate zirtîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hêng thu hi thu mai mai a ni lo, nunna thu a ni. Jordan lui kal kâna in va neih tûr ram in thlen hunah chuan zâwm ula, in dam rei ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Lalpan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Moab ram, Jeriko ep, Abarim tlânga Nebo tlângchhîpah chuan chho la, an chanpual atân Israel-te ka pêk Kanan ram chu thlîr ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />I u Arona Hor tlângah a thi a, a mite hnênah hruai a ni ta ang khân tah chuan i thi ang a, i pi leh pute hnênah i kal ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Zin thlalêr, Meriba-kades tui hmunah khân, Israel-te zîngah ka thu i bawhchhia a, Israel-te hmaah min chawimawi lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan ram chu hla tak aṭang chauhvin i hmu thei ang; Israel mite awmna tûra ka pêk ram chu i rap ve lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian mi Mosia chuan a thih hmain hetiang malsâwmna hi Israel mite tân a dîlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu Sinai tlâng aṭangin a lo kal a, Ni angin Edom ramah a chhuak. Paran tlâng aṭangin a mite a rawn chhun êng a, Vântirhkoh sâng sâwmin an zui a, Mei a alh hluah hluah mai, a ding lamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite a lainat a, A tâte chu a vêng. A thupêkte an dawng a, A hniakhnung an zui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosian Dân thu min pe a, Jakoba thlahte ro hlu ber chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu a mi Israel-te lal a ni, Hnam hruaitute leh Israel pungkhâwmho chungah chuan a lal.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reubena chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Reubena chu thi mang suh se, Tlêm hle tawh mah se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda chungthu sawiin: “Aw Lalpa , Juda mangang au ngaithla la, A unaute fin leh rawh se, A hmêlmate beihpui ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levia chungthu a sawi a: “I chhiahhlawh rinawm Levia thlahte chuan, Urim leh Thumim kawl se, i thu hrilh ṭhîn ang che, Masa-ah khân i fiah a, Meriba tuiah in inchhuahchhalh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nu leh pa, a unaute leh a fate pawh Hrechang lovin a vuan che a. I thupêk a awih a, I thuthlung a vawn tlat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte chu i thuruatte an zirtîr ang a, Israel fate chu i dân an zirtîr ang. I hmaah rimtui an hâl ang, I maichâmah hâlral thilhlan an hâl ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , a neihte chu malsâwm la, A thiltihte lo lâwm ang che. A hmêlmate chu an tha chhahsak la, A hawtute chu dingchhuak suh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin thlahte chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “ Lalpa duhsak leh lainat, A thla hnuaiah a khawsa, Nilênga a vên, a puak tlat ṭhin a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josefa thlahte chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: ‘An ram chu Lalpa chuan vân daifîmin châwm sela, Lei chhûngril aṭanga tui nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An theirahte chuan ni hmu ṭha sela, A hun takah hmin tiar tuar rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An tlâng chhuanawm tak tak leh mualte chu Thei tui tak takin khat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An ramah chuan thil ṭha khat sela, Hnimbuka thusawitu khân malsâwm rawh se, A malsâwmna chu Josefa lu-ah rawn vûr sela, A unaute kaihruaitu a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josefa zawng, bâwngchal anga chak a ni, Sele ki ang ki ṭha a nei, A kîte chu Manasea thlah sâng rual Efraim thlah sîng rual an ni. Hnam dang a si ang a, Kâwlkil thlengin a vawrh darh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun leh Isakar chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Tuifinriata sumdâwng, Zebulun chu hmuingîl rawh se, Isakar pawh in lamah a chan ṭha rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An tlângrama awm tûrin hnam dang an sâwm a, Tah chuan inthawina dikin an inthawi ang. Tuifinriat hausakna an chaw a, A kam ṭiauva thil ṭha an khâwm.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gada chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Gad ram tizautu chu fak rawh u; Bân seh chhûma, lu vun hîk tûra Sakeibaknei biru ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ram ṭha ber an thlang a, Israel hruaitute an pun khâwm khân Hotu chanvo an chantîr a, Lalpa thupêk leh dân an zâwm.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dana thlah chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Dana chu sakeibakneituai; Basan ram aṭangin a lo zuang chhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naftali chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Naftali chuan Lalpa malsâwmna a dawng a, Hnianghnârin duhsakna a dawng; A ram chuan dîl aṭangin chhim lam a thleng.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asera chungchâng hetiangin a sawi: “Fa dangte aiin Asera chu a nihlawh e, A unaute duhsakna dawng sela, A ke chu hriakah chiah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thîr leh dârin an khua chu an kalh ang a, Him takin chêng reng rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Israel-te u, in Pathian ang hi pathian dang an awm lo, Ṭanpui tûr che u-in ropui taka chhûm chunga chuangin Vân khi a fang zung zung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chatuan Pathian chu in vêngtu a ni, A bân chak chuan a hum ṭhîn che u a, In hmaah hmêlma a hnawt chhuak a, ‘Tiral vek rawh u,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakoba thlah Israel-te chu muang takin an awm ta a, Buh leh uain tamna ramah an awm der der, Vân daifîm châwm len te chu an ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw Israel, i va nihlawh kher êm! Nang ang rêng tu mah an awm lo, Lalpa chhandam hnam i ni a, I himna tûr leh hnehtu i nih theih nân Lalpa chu i phaw leh i khandaih a ni. I hmêlmaten khawngaih an dîl ang che; Nangin i lo rapbet ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chu Moab phai, Jeriko khaw ep aṭang chuan Nebo tlângchhîp, Pisga an tihah chuan a lâwn chho va. Lalpa chuan ram chu Gilead aṭangin Dan thlengin a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naftalia te, Manasea te, leh Efraima te ram chu Mediteranean tuipui thlengin a thlîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judai ram chhim lam ram, Zoar aṭanga Tûm khawpui Jeriko khaw thlengin a thlîrtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh Mosia hnênah, “Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna an thlahte pêk ka tiam ram chu hei hi a ni. Ka entîr che a, i kal erawh chu ka phal lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa sawi angin Moab ramah chuan Mosia chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-peor khaw dep, Moab phaiah chuan a phûm a, tûn thlengin tu man a thlân awmna chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thih chuan Mosia chu kum za leh sawmhnih a upa a ni a, a mit pawh a la thim lo, a la chak hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab phaiah chuan Israel-te chuan ni sawmthum an sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuna fapa Josua chu Mosian a aiawhtua a ruat a nih avângin a fing êm êm a, Israel-te chuan Josua thu chu an zâwm a, Mosian Lalpa thupêk a hrilhte pawh an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel zîngah Mosia ang zâwlnei an awm ngai lo; Lalpa chuan hmaichhanah a be ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta lal leh a ṭhuihruaite mit hmuhah leh an ram chhûngah te Mosia hmanga thil mak leh chhinchhiahna ropui a tih ang ti tûrin zâwlnei dang tu mah a hmang ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te hmuha thil ropui leh hlauhawm, Mosia tih ang ti ve zâwlnei dang an awm hek lo.
  </para>
</usx>
